ian Johnson\\u2019s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O\\u2019Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner, Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott, Cailee Spaeny, Daryl McCormack, and Thomas Haden Church.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery   <blockquote><p>\\u201cwhodunnit threequel is murderously good fun\\u201d Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>Benoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson\\u2019s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O\\u2019Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner, Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott, Cailee Spaeny, Daryl McCormack, and Thomas Haden Church.<\\/p> Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery,Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery (Scr 1)  \\u201cwhodunnit threequel is murderously good fun\\u201d Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Benoit Blanc (Daniel Craig) returns for his most dangerous case yet in the third and darkest chapter of Rian Johnson\\u2019s murder mystery opus. Starring Daniel Craig, Josh O\\u2019Connor, Glenn Close, Josh Brolin, Mila Kunis, Jeremy Renner, Kerry Washington, Andrew Scott, Cailee Spaeny, Daryl McCormack, and Thomas Haden Church.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/wk-it-was-just-an-accident\\/\",\"id\":\"411\",\"name\":\"It Was Just an Accident\",\"title\":\"It Was Just an Accident\",\"duration\":\"104 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765411200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/29602\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:40<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765464000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performan