8\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a3\\/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1168\\/cw2158\\/ch2160\\/images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\\"Jafar Panahi takes us on a nightmare trip into a land of bribes and brutality\\\" - Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Winner of the Palme d\\u2019Or at Cannes, IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT is a fearless tour-de-force from cinematic luminary Jafar Panahi. Both urgently political and deeply humane, this new moral classic confronts truth and uncertainty, revenge and mercy, head-on.When auto mechanic Vahid unexpectedly encounters the man who may have been his torturer in prison, he kidnaps him with the intention to exact vengeance. But since the sole clue to Eghbal\\u2019s identity is the distinct squeak of his prosthetic leg, Vahid turns to a loose circle of other now-freed victims for confirmation. And the danger only escalates.As they deal with their past and diverging worldviews, the group struggles to decide: Is this him, without a doubt? What would retribution mean, in actuality?\\u00a0Unraveling against the ever-present backdrop of authoritarianism, IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT coalesces into a climactic act of resistance by an Iranian auteur who is no stranger to unjust detainment himself. Powered by thrilling momentum and peerless craft, France\\u2019s Best International Feature Film entry to the 98th Academy Awards\\u00ae asks us to consider \\u2013 and reconsider \\u2013 the line between right and wrong.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"It Was Just an Accident It Was Just an Accident   <blockquote><p>\\\"Jafar Panahi takes us on a nightmare trip into a land of bribes and brutality\\\" - Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>Winner of the Palme d\\u2019Or at Cannes, <i><strong>IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT<\\/strong><\\/i> is a fearless tour-de-force from cinematic luminary Jafar Panahi. Both urgently political and deeply humane, this new moral classic confronts truth and uncertainty, revenge and mercy, head-on.<\\/p><p>When auto mechanic Vahid unexpectedly encounters the man who may have been his torturer in prison, he kidnaps him with the intention to exact vengeance. But since the sole clue to Eghbal\\u2019s identity is the distinct squeak of his prosthetic leg, Vahid turns to a loose circle of other now-freed victims for confirmation. And the danger only escalates.<\\/p><p>As they deal with their past and diverging worldviews, the group struggles to decide: Is this him, without a doubt? What would retribution mean, in actuality?<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Unraveling against the ever-present backdrop of authoritarianism, <i>IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT<\\/i> coalesces into a climactic act of resistance by an Iranian auteur who is no stranger to unjust detainment himself. Powered by thrilling momentum and peerless craft, France\\u2019s <strong>Best International Feature Film<\\/strong> entry to the 98th Academy Awards\\u00ae asks us to consider \\u2013 and reconsider \\u2013 the line between right and wrong.<\\/p> It Was Just an Accident,It Was Just an Accident (Scr 1)  \\\"Jafar Panahi takes us on a nightmare trip into a land of bribes and brutality\\\" - Guardian \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605Winner of the Palme d\\u2019Or at Cannes, IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT is a fearless tour-de-force from cinematic luminary Jafar Panahi. Both urgently political and deeply humane, this new moral classic confronts truth and uncertainty, revenge and mercy, head-on.When auto mechanic Vahid unexpectedly encounters the man who may have been his torturer in prison, he kidnaps him with the intention to exact vengeance. But since the sole clue to Eghbal\\u2019s identity is the distinct squeak of his prosthetic leg, Vahid turns to a loose circle of other now-freed victims for confirmation. And the danger only escalates.As they deal with their past and diverging worldviews, the group struggles to decide: Is this him, without a doubt? What would retribution mean, in actuality?\\u00a0Unraveling against the ever-present backdrop of authoritarianism, IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT coalesces into a climactic act of resistance by an Iranian auteur who is no stranger to unjust detainment himself. Powered by thrilling momentum and peerless craft, France\\u2019s Best International Feature Film entry to the 98th Academy Awards\\u00ae asks us to consider \\u2013 and reconsider \\u2013 the line between right and wrong.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9l-the-hitchhikers-guide-to-the-galaxy\\/\",\"id\":\"914\",\"name\":\"The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy\",\"title\":\"The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765411200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13724\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765458000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13731\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765461600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13738\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765465200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13765\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765479600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\