1770508800,1770508800,1770681600,1770681600,1770681600,1770768000,1770768000,1770768000,1770854400,1770854400,1770854400,1770854400,1770854400,1770940800,1770940800,1770940800,1771027200,1771027200,1771027200,1771027200,1771027200,1771113600,1771113600,1771113600],\"start_date\":\"1765458000\",\"end_date\":\"1771171200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"OFgvaURGcEY4VEVDYXNubUszWCtQdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 11 Dec 2025 - Sun 15 Feb 2026\",\"text\":\"Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/81\\/39d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff\\/w800\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/8139d948c08747b2c68daf20ddac04ff.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside Studios this November.Join Arthur Dent, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Fenchurch and many more as you escape the destruction of Earth with seconds to spare and begin a search for answers to the mystery of Life, the Universe and Everything, armed only with a towel and one VERY depressed robot.The night begins in a rather unusual pub as you settle in, drink in hand, for an evening of storytelling and spectacle. From there, the story lifts off \\u2013 quite literally \\u2013 as you hitch a ride on a passing spaceship, discover the meaning of life, and join a quest to persuade a group of inter-dimensional mice to give the Earth a second chance.Brought to life by an award-winning creative team, and featuring a multi-talented company of actors, this inventive take on Douglas Adams\\u2019 classic draws from the best examples of immersive, musical theatre, dance and magic to deliver a truly out of this world experience and a complete night out.Warning: Side effects may include sudden existential dread, unexpected hyperspatial detours and a burning desire for a really good cup of tea.BOOK NOW \\u2013 before the end of the Earth! | Tickets from \\u00a342 | Riverside Studios\\u00a0Feeling improbably important? You might be a Person of Galactic Significance. Why not upgrade to a VIP ticket to enjoy:\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Priority entry\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Reserved seating\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x Pan Galactic Gargle Blaster (choose your level of lucidity: alcoholic or non-alcoholic)*\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x collectible \\u2018Infinite Improbability Deck\\u2019 of cards* Or choose from something marginally less mind-altering: beer, house wine, or soft drink.\\u00a0AccessibilityFor access enquiries\\/bookings, please call our Box Office team directly on 0208 237 1010, or email boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk and we will be happy to help with your needs.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy   <h2>Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside Studios this November.<\\/h2><p>Join Arthur Dent, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Fenchurch and many more as you escape the destruction of Earth with seconds to spare and begin a search for answers to the mystery of Life, the Universe and Everything, armed only with a towel and one VERY depressed robot.<\\/p><p>The night begins in a rather unusual pub as you settle in, drink in hand, for an evening of storytelling and spectacle. From there, the story lifts off \\u2013 quite literally \\u2013 as you hitch a ride on a passing spaceship, discover the meaning of life, and join a quest to persuade a group of inter-dimensional mice to give the Earth a second chance.<\\/p><p>Brought to life by an award-winning creative team, and featuring a multi-talented company of actors, this inventive take on Douglas Adams\\u2019 classic draws from the best examples of immersive, musical theatre, dance and magic to deliver a truly out of this world experience and a complete night out.<\\/p><p><i>Warning: Side effects may include sudden existential dread, unexpected hyperspatial detours and a burning desire for a really good cup of tea.<\\/i><\\/p><p><strong>BOOK NOW \\u2013 before the end of the Earth! | Tickets from \\u00a342 | Riverside Studios<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Feeling improbably important? You might be a Person of Galactic Significance. Why not upgrade to a VIP ticket to enjoy:<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Priority entry<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Reserved seating<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1x Pan Galactic Gargle Blaster (choose your level of lucidity: alcoholic or non-alcoholic)*<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1x collectible \\u2018Infinite Improbability Deck\\u2019 of cards<\\/p><p><i>* Or choose from something marginally less mind-altering: beer, house wine, or soft drink.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Accessibility<\\/strong><\\/p><p>For access enquiries\\/bookings, please call our Box Office team directly on <strong>0208 237 1010<\\/strong>, or email <a href=\\\"mailto:boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk\\\"><strong>boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk<\\/strong><\\/a> and we will be happy to help with your needs.<\\/p> The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy  Don\\u2019t panic! A new live version of Douglas Adams\\u2019 mind-blowingly imaginative comedy (mis)adventure, The Hitchhiker\\u2019s Guide to The Galaxy, lands at Riverside Studios this November.Join Arthur Dent, Zaphod Beeblebrox, Fenchurch and many more as you escape the destruction of Earth with seconds to spare and begin a search for answers to the mystery of Life, the Universe and Everything, armed only with a towel and one VERY depressed robot.The night begins in a rather unusual pub as you settle in, drink in hand, for an evening of storytelling and spectacle. From there, the story lifts off \\u2013 quite literally \\u2013 as you hitch a ride on a passing spaceship, discover the meaning of life, and join a quest to persuade a group of inter-dimensional mice to give the Earth a second chance.Brought to life by an award-winning creative team, and featuring a multi-talented company of actors, this inventive take on Douglas Adams\\u2019 classic draws from the best examples of immersive, musical theatre, dance and magic to deliver a truly out of this world experience and a complete night out.Warning: Side effects may include sudden existential dread, unexpected hyperspatial detours and a burning desire for a really good cup of tea.BOOK NOW \\u2013 before the end of the Earth! | Tickets from \\u00a342 | Riverside Studios\\u00a0Feeling improbably important? You might be a Person of Galactic Significance. Why not upgrade to a VIP ticket to enjoy:\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Priority entry\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Reserved seating\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x Pan Galactic Gargle Blaster (choose your level of lucidity: alcoholic or non-alcoholic)*\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 1x collectible \\u2018Infinite Improbability Deck\\u2019 of cards* Or choose from something marginally less mind-altering: beer, house wine, or soft drink.\\u00a0AccessibilityFor access enquiries\\/bookings, please call our Box Office team directly on 0208 237 1010, or email boxoffice@old.riversidestudios.co.uk and we will be happy to help with your needs.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/bm-old-fat-fk-up\\/\",\"id\":\"642\",\"name\":\"Old Fat F**k Up\",\"title\":\"Old Fat F**k Up\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765411200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13771\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765480500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1765670400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13915\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765721700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1765929600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14038\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765998900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765411200,1765670400,1765929600],\"start_date\":\"1765480500\",\"end_date\":\"1765998900\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ckUrMno4ejFFdXNMamJJY3F5Mjh3UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 11 - Wed 17 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Phenomenal. Devastating. Unexpectedly hilarious. - All That Dazzles\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Completely mesmerising, deeply complex, so powerful it\\u2019s impossible to look&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w2667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/91\\/f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1\\/w2667\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx573\\/cw1351\\/ch1354\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Phenomenal. Devastating. Unexpectedly hilarious. - All That Dazzles\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Completely mesmerising, deeply complex, so powerful it\\u2019s impossible to look away - Everything Theatre\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Old Fat F**k Up is the golden ticket, a theatrical gem - North West End\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Laced with humour. Beautiful, raw and deeply human - A Young(ish) PerspectiveEVERYTHING IS GOING TO BE OKAY* \\u00a0Old Fat F**k Up is a show about seeing your naked body in the mirror and crying, discovering your career\\u2019s uncontrollably disintegrating, and realising that suddenly everything costs a bomb. Oh, and now you\\u2019ve got kids too, so there\\u2019s that. Hilarious, right?Following last year's \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 hilarious and terrifying hit, F**king Legend (Pleasance, Edinburgh; Riverside Studios, London), Olly (and his fairly punchable face) returns with a show that rips into the absurdity of modern life, peels back the layers of middle-aged denial and the pain of parenthood, then exposes the wreckage men leave behind when they\\u2019re just trying not to break things.*but may not be. In fact, let\\u2019s be honest, it probably won\\u2019t be.\\u00a0See F**king Legend alongside Olly\\u2019s new show Old Fat F**k Up and get 20% off full-price tickets when booked together in the same transaction. (Offer applies to full-price tickets only; performances do not need to be on the same day.)\\u2018Olly Hawes is a magnificent writer\\u2019 WhatsOnStage\\u2018An entirely innovative and distinctive voice in contemporary theatre\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland\\u2018A magnificent storyteller\\u2019 British Theatre Guide\\u00a0Olly makes shows that explore the tension between the desires of individuals and the stability of collectives. He is co-artistic director of take stock exchange - their latest series of podcasts, Machloket, made with the Royal Court, is available now. He\\u2019s worked with some of the country\\u2019s most prestigious and exciting venues, including the National Theatre, The Young Vic and The Barbican.\\u00a0P Burton-Morgan has been Artistic Director of Metta Theatre since 2005 for which they have written\\/directed over 30 productions including Sherlock Holmes and the PoisonWood (Watermill) and the WGGB award-winning In the Willows (UK tour). Their debut novel Muddying is currently out on submission with United Agents and they're also a Ledbury Festival slam-winning poet.\\u00a0Praise for F**king LegendTOP 10 SHOW Ed Fringe 2024 \\u00a0\\u2018Extraordinary. I can\\u2019t recommend it enough\\u2019 Fergus Morgan, The Crush Bar\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Terrifically smart and discomforting\\u2026 exhilarating\\u2019 The Scotsman\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018A Marvel to Behold\\u2019 All That Dazzles\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Perfectly eccentric, complex, emotional,\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Completely and utterly gripping\\u2019 What\\u2019s Good To Do\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Old Fat F**k Up Old Fat F**k Up   <blockquote><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 <i>Phenomenal. Devastating. Unexpectedly hilarious. - <\\/i>All That Dazzles<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 <i>Completely mesmerising, deeply complex, so powerful it\\u2019s impossible to look away - <\\/i>Everything Theatre<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 <i>Old Fat F**k Up is the golden ticket, a theatrical gem - <\\/i>North West End<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 <i>Laced with humour. Beautiful, raw and deeply human - <\\/i>A Young(ish) Perspective<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p><strong>EVERYTHING IS GOING TO BE OKAY* &nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p><i><strong>Old Fat F**k Up<\\/strong><\\/i> is a show about seeing your naked body in the mirror and crying, discovering your career\\u2019s uncontrollably disintegrating, and realising that suddenly everything costs a bomb. Oh, and now you\\u2019ve got kids too, so there\\u2019s that. Hilarious, right?<\\/p><p>Following last year's \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 hilarious and terrifying hit, F**king Legend (Pleasance, Edinburgh; Riverside Studios, London), Olly (and his fairly punchable face) returns with a show that rips into the absurdity of modern life, peels back the layers of middle-aged denial and the pain of parenthood, then exposes the wreckage men leave behind when they\\u2019re just trying not to break things.<\\/p><p><strong>*but may not be. In fact, let\\u2019s be honest, it probably won\\u2019t be.&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>See <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/old.riversidestudios.co.uk\\/see-and-do\\/fking-legend-202323\\/\\\"><i>F**king Legend<\\/i><\\/a> alongside Olly\\u2019s new show <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/old.riversidestudios.co.uk\\/see-and-do\\/old-fat-fk-up-202325\\/\\\"><i>Old Fat F**k Up<\\/i><\\/a> and get <strong>20% off<\\/strong> full-price tickets when booked together in the same transaction. <i>(Offer applies to full-price tickets only; performances do not need to be on the same day.)<\\/i><\\/p><blockquote><p>\\u2018Olly Hawes is a magnificent writer\\u2019 WhatsOnStage<\\/p><p>\\u2018An entirely innovative and distinctive voice in contemporary theatre\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland<\\/p><p>\\u2018A magnificent storyteller\\u2019 British Theatre Guide<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Olly <\\/strong>makes shows that explore the tension between the desires of individuals and the stability of collectives. He is co-artistic director of take stock exchange - their latest series of podcasts, <strong>Machloket<\\/strong>, made with the Royal Court, is available now. He\\u2019s worked with some of the country\\u2019s most prestigious and exciting venues, including the National Theatre, The Young Vic and The Barbican.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>P Burton-Morgan <\\/strong>has been Artistic Director of Metta Theatre since 2005 for which they have written\\/directed over 30 productions including Sherlock Holmes and the PoisonWood (Watermill) and the WGGB award-winning In the Willows (UK tour). Their debut novel Muddying is currently out on submission with United Agents and they're also a Ledbury Festival slam-winning poet.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Praise for F**king Legend<\\/strong><\\/p><blockquote><p>TOP 10 SHOW Ed Fringe 2024 &nbsp;\\u2018Extraordinary. I can\\u2019t recommend it enough\\u2019 Fergus Morgan, The Crush Bar&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Terrifically smart and discomforting\\u2026 exhilarating\\u2019 The Scotsman&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018A Marvel to Behold\\u2019 All That Dazzles&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Perfectly eccentric, complex, emotional,\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Completely and utterly gripping\\u2019 What\\u2019s Good To Do&nbsp;<\\/p><\\/blockquote> Old Fat F**k Up  \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Phenomenal. Devastating. Unexpectedly hilarious. - All That Dazzles\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Completely mesmerising, deeply complex, so powerful it\\u2019s impossible to look away - Everything Theatre\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Old Fat F**k Up is the golden ticket, a theatrical gem - North West End\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Laced with humour. Beautiful, raw and deeply human - A Young(ish) PerspectiveEVERYTHING IS GOING TO BE OKAY* \\u00a0Old Fat F**k Up is a show about seeing your naked body in the mirror and crying, discovering your career\\u2019s uncontrollably disintegrating, and realising that suddenly everything costs a bomb. Oh, and now you\\u2019ve got kids too, so there\\u2019s that. Hilarious, right?Following last year's \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 hilarious and terrifying hit, F**king Legend (Pleasance, Edinburgh; Riverside Studios, London), Olly (and his fairly punchable face) returns with a show that rips into the absurdity of modern life, peels back the layers of middle-aged denial and the pain of parenthood, then exposes the wreckage men leave behind when they\\u2019re just trying not to break things.*but may not be. In fact, let\\u2019s be honest, it probably won\\u2019t be.\\u00a0See F**king Legend alongside Olly\\u2019s new show Old Fat F**k Up and get 20% off full-price tickets when booked together in the same transaction. (Offer applies to full-price tickets only; performances do not need to be on the same day.)\\u2018Olly Hawes is a magnificent writer\\u2019 WhatsOnStage\\u2018An entirely innovative and distinctive voice in contemporary theatre\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland\\u2018A magnificent storyteller\\u2019 British Theatre Guide\\u00a0Olly makes shows that explore the tension between the desires of individuals and the stability of collectives. He is co-artistic director of take stock exchange - their latest series of podcasts, Machloket, made with the Royal Court, is available now. He\\u2019s worked with some of the country\\u2019s most prestigious and exciting venues, including the National Theatre, The Young Vic and The Barbican.\\u00a0P Burton-Morgan has been Artistic Director of Metta Theatre since 2005 for which they have written\\/directed over 30 productions including Sherlock Holmes and the PoisonWood (Watermill) and the WGGB award-winning In the Willows (UK tour). Their debut novel Muddying is currently out on submission with United Agents and they're also a Ledbury Festival slam-winning poet.\\u00a0Praise for F**king LegendTOP 10 SHOW Ed Fringe 2024 \\u00a0\\u2018Extraordinary. I can\\u2019t recommend it enough\\u2019 Fergus Morgan, The Crush Bar\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Terrifically smart and discomforting\\u2026 exhilarating\\u2019 The Scotsman\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018A Marvel to Behold\\u2019 All That Dazzles\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Perfectly eccentric, complex, emotional,\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland\\u00a0\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Completely and utterly gripping\\u2019 What\\u2019s Good To Do\\u00a0\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1b-disco-cise\\/\",\"id\":\"568\",\"name\":\"Disco-cise\",\"title\":\"Disco-cise\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765411200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13758\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765477800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765411200],\"start_date\":\"1765477800\",\"end_date\":\"1765477800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"dE9hU1B4eng4RU40ZW1nNEtaQUVkUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 11 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"Dancercise with Anna as you know it, but turned up a notch.If you\\u2019ve been to one of Anna\\u2019s classes before, you know the score; a low pressure, fun, supportive&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w2160\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/fb\\/cc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54\\/w2160\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/fbcc7d335dca5eec1f52764bbe981d54.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Dancercise with Anna as you know it, but turned up a notch.If you\\u2019ve been to one of Anna\\u2019s classes before, you know the score; a low pressure, fun, supportive and silly environment where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose all inhibitions and simply dance like no one is watching. It\\u2019s a space to freely move your body with your friends and enjoy a workout that truly doesn\\u2019t feel like exercise!The playlists are a huge part of Dancercise classes, and so here\\u2019s the fun part: Reuben, Riverside\\u2019s resident DJ, will be mixing the tracks and DJ\\u2019ing live during class. With lighting, a live DJ and optional drinks at the end of class, this collaboration promises to be the workout of the year. Bring a friend and enjoy a mid week party at Riverside!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13758\\/\",\"search\":\"Disco-cise Disco-cise   <h2>Dancercise with Anna as you know it, but turned up a notch.<\\/h2><p>If you\\u2019ve been to one of Anna\\u2019s classes before, you know the score; a low pressure, fun, supportive and silly environment where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose all inhibitions and simply dance like no one is watching. It\\u2019s a space to freely move your body with your friends and enjoy a workout that truly doesn\\u2019t feel like exercise!<\\/p><p><br>The playlists are a huge part of <strong>Dancercise <\\/strong>classes, and so here\\u2019s the fun part: Reuben, Riverside\\u2019s resident DJ, will be mixing the tracks and DJ\\u2019ing live during class. With lighting, a live DJ and optional drinks at the end of class, this collaboration promises to be the workout of the year. Bring a friend and enjoy a mid week party at Riverside!<\\/p> Disco-cise  Dancercise with Anna as you know it, but turned up a notch.If you\\u2019ve been to one of Anna\\u2019s classes before, you know the score; a low pressure, fun, supportive and silly environment where you\\u2019re encouraged to lose all inhibitions and simply dance like no one is watching. It\\u2019s a space to freely move your body with your friends and enjoy a workout that truly doesn\\u2019t feel like exercise!The playlists are a huge part of Dancercise classes, and so here\\u2019s the fun part: Reuben, Riverside\\u2019s resident DJ, will be mixing the tracks and DJ\\u2019ing live during class. With lighting, a live DJ and optional drinks at the end of class, this collaboration promises to be the workout of the year. Bring a friend and enjoy a mid week party at Riverside!\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/bZ-yoga-for-all-from-lumi-foundation\\/\",\"id\":\"637\",\"name\":\"Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation\",\"title\":\"Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765411200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13751\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765477800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1766016000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14101\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1766082600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765411200,1766016000],\"start_date\":\"1765477800\",\"end_date\":\"1766082600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"MnprMWRhMHBlbXdQLzBxRmZPZVJsQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 11 - Thu 18 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!&nbsp; Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.&nbsp;&nbsp;The&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/7c\\/01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965\\/w1197\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx402\\/cw631\\/ch631\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!\\u00a0 Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.\\u00a0\\u00a0The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.\\u00a0 Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.Please bring your own mat if you can.\\u00a0 A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.\\u00a0 This class can also be done using a chair for support.\\u00a0Your teacher will be from Lumi Foundation with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.\\u00a0 Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!\\u00a0About Lumi FoundationLumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation   <p>Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!&nbsp; Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.&nbsp; Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.<\\/p><p>Please bring your own mat if you can.&nbsp; A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.&nbsp; This class can also be done using a chair for support.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Your teacher will be from <strong>Lumi Foundation<\\/strong> with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.&nbsp; Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About Lumi Foundation<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Lumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!<\\/p><p>Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.<\\/p><p>Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.<\\/p><p>Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community.<\\/p> Not-For-Profit Yoga,Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation  Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!\\u00a0 Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.\\u00a0\\u00a0The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.\\u00a0 Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.Please bring your own mat if you can.\\u00a0 A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.\\u00a0 This class can also be done using a chair for support.\\u00a0Your teacher will be from Lumi Foundation with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.\\u00a0 Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!\\u00a0About Lumi FoundationLumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LN-the-cure-the-show-of-a-lost-world\\/\",\"id\":\"507\",\"name\":\"The Cure: The Show of a Lost World\",\"title\":\"The Cure: The Show of a Lost World\",\"duration\":\"167 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765411200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13776\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:50<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765482600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1765670400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13918\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765722600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765411200,1765670400],\"start_date\":\"1765482600\",\"end_date\":\"1765722600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"NkJkRzNxa2NnajFaOEpVcjRDN1Rrdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 11 - Sun 14 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"The Cure\\u2019s widely acclaimed album, 'SONGS OF A LOST WORLD\\u2019 was released in November 2024 and on the night of the album\\u2019s unveiling, the band performed&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/49\\/9f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/499f3f5d4a880a86ac37d4b4ba5d6c0f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"The Cure\\u2019s widely acclaimed album, 'SONGS OF A LOST WORLD\\u2019 was released in November 2024 and on the night of the album\\u2019s unveiling, the band performed the record in full for the first and only time, at London\\u2019s Troxy where 3,000 fans attended and tickets sold out within seconds. THE CURE: THE SHOW OF A LOST WORLD is a remixed, recut and 4K remastered film of that night\\u2019s full 31-song show, directed by Grammy-nominated Nick Wickham, with new surround sound mix by Robert Smith.\\u00a0Formed in 1978 in Crawley, West Sussex, by vocalist, guitarist, and songwriter Robert Smith, The Cure have sold over 30 million albums worldwide, headlined the Glastonbury Festival four times, and been inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2019. They are considered one of the most influential bands to have ever emerged from the UK.Their biggest hits include Just Like Heaven, Friday I'm in Love and Boys Don't Cry.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"The Cure: The Show of a Lost World The Cure: The Show of a Lost World   <p>The Cure\\u2019s widely acclaimed album, '<i><strong>SONGS OF A LOST WORLD<\\/strong><\\/i>\\u2019 was released in November 2024 and on the night of the album\\u2019s unveiling, the band performed the record in full for the first and only time, at London\\u2019s Troxy where 3,000 fans attended and tickets sold out within seconds.<i><strong> THE CURE: THE SHOW OF A LOST WORLD <\\/strong><\\/i>is a remixed, recut and 4K remastered film of that night\\u2019s full 31-song show, directed by Grammy-nominated Nick Wickham, with new surround sound mix by Robert Smith.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Formed in 1978 in Crawley, West Sussex, by vocalist, guitarist, and songwriter Robert Smith, <strong>The Cure <\\/strong>have sold over 30 million albums worldwide, headlined the Glastonbury Festival four times, and been inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2019. They are considered one of the most influential bands to have ever emerged from the UK.<\\/p><p>Their biggest hits include <i>Just Like Heaven<\\/i>, <i>Friday I'm in Love<\\/i> and <i>Boys Don't Cry<\\/i>.<\\/p> The Cure: The Show of a Lost World  The Cure\\u2019s widely acclaimed album, 'SONGS OF A LOST WORLD\\u2019 was released in November 2024 and on the night of the album\\u2019s unveiling, the band performed the record in full for the first and only time, at London\\u2019s Troxy where 3,000 fans attended and tickets sold out within seconds. THE CURE: THE SHOW OF A LOST WORLD is a remixed, recut and 4K remastered film of that night\\u2019s full 31-song show, directed by Grammy-nominated Nick Wickham, with new surround sound mix by Robert Smith.\\u00a0Formed in 1978 in Crawley, West Sussex, by vocalist, guitarist, and songwriter Robert Smith, The Cure have sold over 30 million albums worldwide, headlined the Glastonbury Festival four times, and been inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame in 2019. They are considered one of the most influential bands to have ever emerged from the UK.Their biggest hits include Just Like Heaven, Friday I'm in Love and Boys Don't Cry.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9f-third-age-on-stage-acting-workshops-for-the-over-50s\\/\",\"id\":\"922\",\"name\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s\",\"title\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765497600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13791\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765548000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1766102400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14123\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1766152800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765497600,1766102400],\"start_date\":\"1765548000\",\"end_date\":\"1766152800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"d3dFcGhUL0xWVkFtZU9FVkdBcnd4UT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 12 - Fri 19 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!The class will open again for new members in autumn.Run by Dive In Associate,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ae\\/4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx780\\/cy8\\/cw1661\\/ch1659\\/images\\/uploads\\/ae4e3b3a79bdf2cfbebe79d64feeba5a.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!The class will open again for new members in autumn.Run by Dive In Associate, Cats Whiskers Community Arts, these weekly drama workshops include voice and speech training, movement, improvisation, character creation and work with texts. They aim to improve self-confidence and memory in a relaxed and fun environment.\\u00a0\\u00a0Drama teacher and director Carol Allen from Cats Whiskers Community Arts has been teaching adult drama classes for over fifteen years, in which time her students have taken part in live performances at venues including Kensington Palace, the Drayton Arms Theatre and the Bush theatre. Students have also appeared in short films.\\u00a0 The Riverside group started in the midst of Covid in 2020 and members have written and performed short plays with Riverscribes, plus a full length revue, \\u201cThe Seven Ages of Us\\u201d and most recently an informal programme of sketches, poetry and song.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s   <h2>Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!<\\/h2><p>The class will open again for new members in autumn.<\\/p><p>Run by Dive In Associate, <strong>Cats Whiskers Community Arts<\\/strong>, these weekly drama workshops include voice and speech training, movement, improvisation, character creation and work with texts. They aim to improve self-confidence and memory in a relaxed and fun environment.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Drama teacher and director<strong> Carol Allen<\\/strong> from Cats Whiskers Community Arts has been teaching adult drama classes for over fifteen years, in which time her students have taken part in live performances at venues including Kensington Palace, the Drayton Arms Theatre and the Bush theatre. Students have also appeared in short films.&nbsp; The Riverside group started in the midst of Covid in 2020 and members have written and performed short plays with Riverscribes, plus a full length revue, \\u201cThe Seven Ages of Us\\u201d and most recently an informal programme of sketches, poetry and song.<\\/p> Third Age on Stage: Acting Workshops for the Over 50s  Learn new acting and performance skills. Veterans and beginners are welcome!The class will open again for new members in autumn.Run by Dive In Associate, Cats Whiskers Community Arts, these weekly drama workshops include voice and speech training, movement, improvisation, character creation and work with texts. They aim to improve self-confidence and memory in a relaxed and fun environment.\\u00a0\\u00a0Drama teacher and director Carol Allen from Cats Whiskers Community Arts has been teaching adult drama classes for over fifteen years, in which time her students have taken part in live performances at venues including Kensington Palace, the Drayton Arms Theatre and the Bush theatre. Students have also appeared in short films.\\u00a0 The Riverside group started in the midst of Covid in 2020 and members have written and performed short plays with Riverscribes, plus a full length revue, \\u201cThe Seven Ages of Us\\u201d and most recently an informal programme of sketches, poetry and song.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1K-eleanor-the-great\\/\",\"id\":\"578\",\"name\":\"Eleanor The Great\",\"title\":\"Eleanor The Great\",\"duration\":\"99 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765497600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13800\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765561500\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1765584000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13869\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:45<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765647900\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1765670400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a