bfe44.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"The directing debut of Scarlett JohanssonIn Eleanor The Great, June Squibb brings to vivid life the witty and proudly troublesome 94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein, who after a devastating loss, tells a tale that takes on a dangerous life of its own. Scarlett Johansson\\u2019s directorial debut is a comically poignant exploration of how the stories we hear become the stories we tell.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Eleanor The Great Eleanor The Great   <h2>The directing debut of Scarlett Johansson<\\/h2><p>In <i><strong>Eleanor The Great<\\/strong><\\/i>, June Squibb brings to vivid life the witty and proudly troublesome 94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein, who after a devastating loss, tells a tale that takes on a dangerous life of its own. Scarlett Johansson\\u2019s directorial debut is a comically poignant exploration of how the stories we hear become the stories we tell.<\\/p> Eleanor The Great  The directing debut of Scarlett JohanssonIn Eleanor The Great, June Squibb brings to vivid life the witty and proudly troublesome 94-year-old Eleanor Morgenstein, who after a devastating loss, tells a tale that takes on a dangerous life of its own. Scarlett Johansson\\u2019s directorial debut is a comically poignant exploration of how the stories we hear become the stories we tell.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/cB-live-next-to-the-apollo\\/\",\"id\":\"463\",\"name\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"title\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765497600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13804\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765566000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1765843200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_na