PNG\\/images\\/uploads\\/947bf5ffc36087c664368b1dff6c21a3.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/7bf5ffc36087c664368b1dff6c21a3\\/w1677\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/images\\/uploads\\/947bf5ffc36087c664368b1dff6c21a3.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/94\\/7bf5ffc36087c664368b1dff6c21a3\\/w1677\\/q80\\/wpoPNG\\/images\\/uploads\\/947bf5ffc36087c664368b1dff6c21a3.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\\"Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd and Harry Melling play unlikely lovers in this sweet and extremely revealing first-time drama from Harry Lighton\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0fColin (Harry Melling) leads a humdrum existence until he meets the impossibly handsome Ray (Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd), a mysterious biker he is soon desperately devoted to. As Colin submits to Ray and enters an exciting new world of desire, he must decide the limits of his devotion.\\u00a0Hilarious, subversive and sexy, PILLION is the acclaimed and surprisingly tender love story from writer-director Harry Lighton.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Pillion Pillion   <blockquote><p>\\\"Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd and Harry Melling play unlikely lovers in this sweet and extremely revealing first-time drama from Harry Lighton\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0f<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>Colin (Harry Melling) leads a humdrum existence until he meets the impossibly handsome Ray (Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd), a mysterious biker he is soon desperately devoted to. As Colin submits to Ray and enters an exciting new world of desire, he must decide the limits of his devotion.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Hilarious, subversive and sexy, <i><strong>PILLION <\\/strong><\\/i>is the acclaimed and surprisingly tender love story from writer-director Harry Lighton.<\\/p> Pillion (Scr 2),Pillion  \\\"Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd and Harry Melling play unlikely lovers in this sweet and extremely revealing first-time drama from Harry Lighton\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0fColin (Harry Melling) leads a humdrum existence until he meets the impossibly handsome Ray (Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd), a mysterious biker he is soon desperately devoted to. As Colin submits to Ray and enters an exciting new world of desire, he must decide the limits of his devotion.\\u00a0Hilarious, subversive and sexy, PILLION is the acclaimed and surprisingly tender love story from writer-director Harry Lighton.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9a-the-jolly-djembe-club\\/\",\"id\":\"917\",\"name\":\"The Jolly Djembe Club\",\"title\":\"The Jolly Djembe Club\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765584000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13821\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765623600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1769212800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22603\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769252400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765584000,1769212800],\"start_date\":\"1765623600\",\"end_date\":\"1769252400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VTBjVnNlbmY0VktWc3RQTEE2Wk5hZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 13 Dec 2025 - Sat 24 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f3\\/9343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85\\/w1269\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/f39343ee72564ed12f1424a5403bad85.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with our\\u00a0Jolly Djembe African Drumming\\u00a0session. Kids will embark on a thrilling journey to discover the rhythms of Africa, learning the art of African Djembe drumming, new songs, and infectious beats.\\u00a0But that's not all\\u2014young adventurers will also take part in an exciting mission to help us save our endangered mangoes before the rainy season arrives through our inactive storytelling. This is a celebration filled with music, fun, and cultural exploration.\\u00a0Book your spot now\\u00a0for a magical experience like no other!\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"The Jolly Djembe Club The Jolly Djembe Club   <p>Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with our&nbsp;<strong>Jolly Djembe African Drumming<\\/strong>&nbsp;session. Kids will embark on a thrilling journey to discover the rhythms of Africa, learning the art of African Djembe drumming, new songs, and infectious beats.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>But that's not all\\u2014young adventurers will also take part in an exciting mission to help us save our endangered mangoes before the rainy season arrives through our inactive storytelling. This is a celebration filled with music, fun, and cultural exploration.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Book your spot now<\\/strong>&nbsp;for a magical experience like no other!<\\/p> The Jolly Djembe Club  Don't miss out on an unforgettable cultural adventure at Riverside Studios! Join Mangotree Kids as we bring the vibrant energy of Africa to life with our\\u00a0Jolly Djembe African Drumming\\u00a0session. Kids will embark on a thrilling journey to discover the rhythms of Africa, learning the art of African Djembe drumming, new songs, and infectious beats.\\u00a0But that's not all\\u2014young adventurers will also take part in an exciting mission to help us save our endangered mangoes before the rainy season arrives through our inactive storytelling. This is a celebration filled with music, fun, and cultural exploration.\\u00a0Book your spot now\\u00a0for a magical experience like no other!\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9y-thunderball-60th-anniversary-screening-live-qa-with-martine-beswick\\/\",\"id\":\"924\",\"name\":\"Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick\",\"title\":\"Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick\",\"duration\":\"129 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765584000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13850\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765634400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765584000],\"start_date\":\"1765634400\",\"end_date\":\"1765634400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cENyL2owQ1FSaGlYTlR0T3ZjeVE0QT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 13 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"SpyHards Podcast presents: Spies on Screen is a exciting new programming strand at Riverside Studios! SpyHards is the world\\u2019s leading podcast focused&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d8\\/67fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx737\\/cy266\\/cw2452\\/ch2454\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"SpyHards Podcast presents: Spies on Screen is a exciting new programming strand at Riverside Studios! SpyHards is the world\\u2019s leading podcast focused exclusively on spy movies and television. Hosted by Scott Hardy and Cam Smith, the show provides weekly deep dives into espionage cinema\\u2014from beloved blockbusters to forgotten cult favourites\\u2014alongside interviews with the actors, filmmakers, and creators behind the genre\\u2019s most iconic works.We are delighted for this inaugural event to be welcoming actor Martine Beswick to discuss her role in the iconic 007 franchise, following an anniversary screening of the Sean Connery-starring Bond adventure THUNDERBALL, in which she played Paula. Martine will also be signing autographs later in the cinema foyer (separate fees may apply).\\u00a0THUNDERBALL (1965)Led by one-eyed evil mastermind Emilio Largo (Adolfo Celi), the terrorist group SPECTRE hijacks two warheads from a NATO plane and threatens widespread nuclear destruction to extort millions of pounds. The dashing Agent 007, James Bond (Sean Connery), is sent to recover the warheads from the heart of Largo's lair in the Bahamas, facing underwater attacks from sharks and men alike. He must also convince the enchanting Domino (Claudine Auger), Largo's mistress, to become a key ally.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13850\\/\",\"search\":\"Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick   <p><strong>SpyHards Podcast presents: Spies on Screen<\\/strong> is a exciting new programming strand at <strong>Riverside Studios<\\/strong>! <strong>SpyHards<\\/strong> is the world\\u2019s leading podcast focused exclusively on spy movies and television. Hosted by Scott Hardy and Cam Smith, the show provides weekly deep dives into espionage cinema\\u2014from beloved blockbusters to forgotten cult favourites\\u2014alongside interviews with the actors, filmmakers, and creators behind the genre\\u2019s most iconic works.<\\/p><p>We are delighted for this inaugural event to be welcoming actor <strong>Martine Beswick<\\/strong> to discuss her role in the iconic 007 franchise, following an anniversary screening of the Sean Connery-starring Bond adventure <i><strong>THUNDERBALL<\\/strong><\\/i>, in which she played Paula. Martine will also be signing autographs later in the cinema foyer (separate fees may apply).<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>THUNDERBALL <\\/strong><\\/i><strong>(1965)<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Led by one-eyed evil mastermind Emilio Largo (Adolfo Celi), the terrorist group SPECTRE hijacks two warheads from a NATO plane and threatens widespread nuclear destruction to extort millions of pounds. The dashing Agent 007, James Bond (Sean Connery), is sent to recover the warheads from the heart of Largo's lair in the Bahamas, facing underwater attacks from sharks and men alike. He must also convince the enchanting Domino (Claudine Auger), Largo's mistress, to become a key ally.<\\/p> Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick  SpyHards Podcast presents: Spies on Screen is a exciting new programming strand at Riverside Studios! SpyHards is the world\\u2019s leading podcast focused exclusively on spy movies and television. Hosted by Scott Hardy and Cam Smith, the show provides weekly deep dives into espionage cinema\\u2014from beloved blockbusters to forgotten cult favourites\\u2014alongside interviews with the actors, filmmakers, and creators behind the genre\\u2019s most iconic works.We are delighted for this inaugural event to be welcoming actor Martine Beswick to discuss her role in the iconic 007 franchise, following an anniversary screening of the Sean Connery-starring Bond adventure THUNDERBALL, in which she played Paula. Martine will also be signing autographs later in the cinema foyer (separate fees may apply).\\u00a0THUNDERBALL (1965)Led by one-eyed evil mastermind Emilio Largo (Adolfo Celi), the terrorist group SPECTRE hijacks two warheads from a NATO plane and threatens widespread nuclear destruction to extort millions of pounds. The dashing Agent 007, James Bond (Sean Connery), is sent to recover the warheads from the heart of Largo's lair in the Bahamas, facing underwater attacks from sharks and men alike. He must also convince the enchanting Domino (Claudine Auger), Largo's mistress, to become a key ally.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1m-explore-creativity-calm-an-abstract-art-workshop-with-mindfulness-practices\\/\",\"id\":\"580\",\"name\":\"Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices\",\"title\":\"Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765584000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13843\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765634400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1765584000],\"start_date\":\"1765634400\",\"end_date\":\"1765634400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VlBhd0hlUWh3NDQ2QWxMdkR0ck0zUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 13 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"Discover the therapeutic power of abstract art at Riverside StudiosJoin artist Roya Nozadi for a gentle, grounding workshop designed to be more than a&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cd\\/2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx271\\/cw661\\/ch663\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Discover the therapeutic power of abstract art at Riverside StudiosJoin artist Roya Nozadi for a gentle, grounding workshop designed to be more than a painting class, it\\u2019s a practice for your mind, helping you find relief, focus, and creative challenge.No experience required, just curiosity. Ages 16+.What to expect:Explore how to quiet your mind and being presentExplore intuitive mark-making. Let go of perfection and enjoy creating without rules or pressure.Explore colour, form and line. Build the foundations for future sessions where we\\u2019ll explore texture, collage, and deeper techniques.Explore connection with like-minded people in a warm, supportive creative space\\u00a0All materials are included. You will leave with a clear mind and a finished artwork to take home. Meet the Artist: https:\\/\\/royanozadi.com\\/ Roya Nozadi will guide you through this mindful, creative journey.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13843\\/\",\"search\":\"Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices   <p>Discover the therapeutic power of abstract art at Riverside Studios<\\/p><p>Join artist Roya Nozadi for a gentle, grounding workshop designed to be more than a painting class, it\\u2019s a practice for your mind, helping you find relief, focus, and creative challenge.<\\/p><p>No experience required, just curiosity. Ages 16+.<\\/p><p>What to expect:<\\/p><ul><li>Explore how to quiet your mind and being present<\\/li><li>Explore intuitive mark-making. Let go of perfection and enjoy creating without rules or pressure.<\\/li><li>Explore colour, form and line. Build the foundations for future sessions where we\\u2019ll explore texture, collage, and deeper techniques.<\\/li><li>Explore connection with like-minded people in a warm, supportive creative space<\\/li><\\/ul><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>All materials are included. You will leave with a clear mind and a finished artwork to take home. Meet the Artist: https:\\/\\/royanozadi.com\\/ Roya Nozadi will guide you through this mindful, creative journey.<\\/p> Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices  Discover the therapeutic power of abstract art at Riverside StudiosJoin artist Roya Nozadi for a gentle, grounding workshop designed to be more than a painting class, it\\u2019s a practice for your mind, helping you find relief, focus, and creative challenge.No experience required, just curiosity. Ages 16+.What to expect:Explore how to quiet your mind and being presentExplore intuitive mark-making. Let go of perfection and enjoy creating without rules or pressure.Explore colour, form and line. Build the foundations for future sessions where we\\u2019ll explore texture, collage, and deeper techniques.Explore connection with like-minded people in a warm, supportive creative space\\u00a0All materials are included. You will leave with a clear mind and a finished artwork to take home. Meet the Artist: https:\\/\\/royanozadi.com\\/ Roya Nozadi will guide you through this mindful, creative journey.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1C-how-the-grinch-stole-christmas-25th-anniversary\\/\",\"id\":\"585\",\"name\":\"How the Grinch Stole Christmas: 25th Anniversary\",\"title\":\"How the Grinch Stole Christmas: 25th Anniversary\",\"d