bf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/92\\/7d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771\\/w750\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx83\\/cy3\\/cw614\\/ch613\\/images\\/uploads\\/927d070abf93b6f61225581a610fb771.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201dLife can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. Beat the Stress is your chance to let it all go through the powerful, uplifting energy of African Djembe drumming.Step into the ultimate drum circle, where every beat helps you release tension, spark creativity, and connect with the ancient rhythms of Africa. Discover the joy of learning new patterns, embrace Rhythm Meditation, and experience the deep calm and joy of Djembe.Be part of our Djembe Revolution!\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults   <h3>\\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201d<\\/h3><p>Life can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. <strong>Beat the Stress <\\/strong>is your chance to let it all go through the powerful, uplifting energy of <strong>African Djembe drumming<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p>Step into the <strong>ultimate drum circle<\\/strong>, where every beat helps you release tension, spark creativity, and connect with the ancient rhythms of Africa. Discover the joy of learning new patterns, embrace Rhythm Meditation, and experience the deep calm and joy of Djembe.<\\/p><p><strong>Be part of our Djembe Revolution!<\\/strong><\\/p> Beat the Stress: Djembe Drumming for Adults  \\u201cEyes closed and listening to the rhythm of the drum\\u201dLife can feel overwhelming at times \\u2014 but stress doesn\\u2019t have to win. Beat the Stress is your chance to let it all go through the powerful, uplifting energy of African Djembe drumming.Step into the ultimate drum circle, where every beat helps you release tension, spark creativity, and connect with the ancient rhythms of Africa. Discover the joy of learning new patterns, embrace Rhythm Meditation, and experience the deep calm and joy of Djembe.Be part of our Djembe Revolution!\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/NZ-sound-bath-total-relaxation\\/\",\"id\":\"699\",\"name\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation\",\"title\":\"Sound Bath: Total Relaxation\",\"duration\":\"70 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1765670400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13929\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765724400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/13947\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">16:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1765729800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768003200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23002\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">15:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768057200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"},{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14610\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">16:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768062600\",\"