y13\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/52\\/83c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx322\\/cy13\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/52\\/83c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx322\\/cy13\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/52\\/83c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx322\\/cy13\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/52\\/83c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d\\/w2000\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx322\\/cy13\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/52\\/83c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d\\/w2000\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx322\\/cy13\\/cw1322\\/ch1320\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"\\\"Ethan Hawke is terrific in Richard Linklater\\u2019s bitter Broadway breakup drama\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0fRichard Linklater (Boyhood, The Before Trilogy) re-teams once more with Ethan Hawke for this acclaimed look at the twilight years of one of the world's great song maestros.On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi\\u2019s bar as his former collaborator Richard Rodgers celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical \\u201cOklahoma!\\u201d.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14093\\/\",\"search\":\"Blue Moon Blue Moon   <blockquote><p>\\\"Ethan Hawke is terrific in Richard Linklater\\u2019s bitter Broadway breakup drama\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>Richard Linklater (<i>Boyhood<\\/i>, <i>The Before Trilogy<\\/i>) re-teams once more with Ethan Hawke for this acclaimed look at the twilight years of one of the world's great song maestros.<\\/p><p>On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi\\u2019s bar as his former collaborator Richard Rodgers celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical \\u201c<i>Oklahoma<\\/i>!\\u201d.<\\/p> Blue Moon (Scr 1),Blue Moon  \\\"Ethan Hawke is terrific in Richard Linklater\\u2019s bitter Broadway breakup drama\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0fRichard Linklater (Boyhood, The Before Trilogy) re-teams once more with Ethan Hawke for this acclaimed look at the twilight years of one of the world's great song maestros.On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi\\u2019s bar as his former collaborator Richard Rodgers celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical \\u201cOklahoma!\\u201d.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Lo-baby-broadway\\/\",\"id\":\"553\",\"name\":\"Baby Broadway\",\"title\":\"Baby Broadway\",\"duration\":\"45 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1766102400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14115\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1766142000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1766102400],\"start_date\":\"1766142000\",\"end_date\":\"1766142000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"L0RGOUthWFhEazNKY2ZrZzJRb3RVUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\