age_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/f6\\/d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx122\\/cy139\\/cw3253\\/ch3248\\/images\\/uploads\\/f6d35809652dfc4dcb1df2851c75bcbc.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"This December, join us for a magical Baby Broadway concert that brings the spirit of Christmas to life for families with young children! Sing and dance along to festive showtunes from hit musicals and beloved Christmas films, all performed by two talented West End singers.Enjoy classic songs from Elf, White Christmas, The Snowman, Frozen, and more. Festive fancy dress is encouraged, and the fun doesn\\u2019t stop there: expect bubbles, bells, flying babies, and puppetry for a truly interactive concert experience.Open to all ages from newborns to school-aged kids and grandparents, this 45-minute concert is the perfect way to celebrate the holiday season. Doors open 15 minutes before showtime. This lively concert is all about the music, with no costumes or elaborate staging - just festive fun for all.Open to all ages (recommended 0-7). Babies under 12 months go free and do not require a ticket.Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas with Baby Broadway!\\u00a0Visit the Baby Broadway website for more information.\\u201cTip-top show tunes that worm their way into ears of all ages\\u201d - Time Out London\\\"Actually entertaining for adults and simply magical for the kids\\\" -\\u00a0@daddyshortlegs\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14115\\/\",\"search\":\"Baby Broadway Baby Broadway   <p><strong>This December, join us for a magical Baby Broadway concert that brings the spirit of Christmas to life for families with young children! <\\/strong>Sing and dance along to festive showtunes from hit musicals and beloved Christmas films, all performed by two talented West End singers.<\\/p><p>Enjoy classic songs from <i>Elf, White Christmas, The Snowman, Frozen<\\/i>, and more. Festive fancy dress is encouraged, and the fun doesn\\u2019t stop there: expect bubbles, bells, flying babies, and puppetry for a truly interactive concert experience.<\\/p><p>Open to all ages from newborns to school-aged kids and grandparents, this 45-minute concert is the perfect way to celebrate the holiday season. Doors open 15 minutes before showtime. This lively concert is all about the music, with no costumes or elaborate staging - just festive fun for all.<\\/p><p><strong>Open to all ages (recommended 0-7). Babies under 12 months go free and do not require a ticket.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas with Baby Broadway!<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Visit the <a href=\\\"http:\\/\\/www.babybroadway.co.uk\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">Baby Broadway website<\\/a> for more information.<\\/p><blockquote><p><i>\\u201cTip-top show tunes that worm their way into ears of all ages\\u201d - Time Out London<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>\\\"Actually entertaining for adults and simply magical for the kids\\\" -&nbsp;@daddyshortlegs<\\/i><\\/p><\\/blockquote> Baby Broadway  This December, join us for a magical Baby Broadway concert that brings the spirit of Christmas to life for families with young children! Sing and dance along to festive showtunes from hit musicals and beloved Christmas films, all performed by two talented West End singers.Enjoy classic songs from Elf, White Christmas, The Snowman, Frozen, and more. Festive fancy dress is encouraged, and the fun doesn\\u2019t stop there: expect bubbles, bells, flying babies, and puppetry for a truly interactive concert experience.Open to all ages from newborns to school-aged kids and grandparents, this 45-minute concert is the perfect way to celebrate the holiday season. Doors open 15 minutes before showtime. This lively concert is all about the music, with no costumes or elaborate staging - just festive fun for all.Open to all ages (recommended 0-7). Babies under 12 months go free and do not require a ticket.Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas with Baby Broadway!\\u00a0Visit the Baby Broadway website for more information.\\u201cTip-top show tunes that worm their way into ears of all ages\\u201d - Time Out London\\\"Actually entertaining for adults and simply magical for the kids\\\" -\\u00a0@daddyshortlegs\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/16-line-dancing\\/\",\"id\":\"605\",\"name\":\"Line Dancing\",\"title\":\"Line Dancing\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1766102400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"perf