4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/42\\/6bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/426bc4b9686fe797e07b1cdaccf367f0.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Legendary filmmaker James Cameron transports audiences back to the breathtaking world of Pandora with AVATAR: FIRE & ASH, an immersive new adventure with Marine turned Na\\u2019vi leader Jake Sully (Sam Worthington) and Na\\u2019vi warrior Neytiri (Zoe Salda\\u00f1a), who have established a close-knit family and built a life with the ocean-dwelling Metkayina. But, their peace is threatened when they find themselves on a collision course with a deadly new Na\\u2019vi clan: the Mangkwan, also known as the Ash People.As with all AVATAR films, AVATAR: FIRE & ASH features all the things moviegoers have come to expect from a James Cameron film: thrilling action, grand spectacle, unforgettable characters who forge profound connections, and, most importantly, a story that will both move and inspire audiences around the globe.\\u00a0AVATAR: FIRE & ASH\\u00a0contains several sequences of bright lights which may affect customers who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or other photo sensitivities.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Avatar: Fire & Ash Avatar: Fire & Ash   <p>Legendary filmmaker James Cameron transports audiences back to the breathtaking world of Pandora with <i><strong>AVATAR: FIRE &amp; ASH<\\/strong><\\/i>, an immersive new adventure with Marine turned Na\\u2019vi leader Jake Sully (Sam Worthington) and Na\\u2019vi warrior Neytiri (Zoe Salda\\u00f1a), who have established a close-knit family and built a life with the ocean-dwelling Metkayina. But, their peace is threatened when they find themselves on a collision course with a deadly new Na\\u2019vi clan: the Mangkwan, also known as the Ash People.<\\/p><p>As with all <strong>AVATAR <\\/strong>films, <i>AVATAR: FIRE &amp; ASH <\\/i>features all the things moviegoers have come to expect from a James Cameron film: thrilling action, grand spectacle, unforgettable characters who forge profound connections, and, most importantly, a story that will both move and inspire audiences around the globe.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>AVATAR: FIRE &amp; ASH<\\/strong>&nbsp;contains several sequences of bright lights which may affect customers who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or other photo sensitivities.<\\/p> Avatar: Fire & Ash,Avatar: Fire & Ash (Scr 1)  Legendary filmmaker James Cameron transports audiences back to the breathtaking world of Pandora with AVATAR: FIRE & ASH, an immersive new adventure with Marine turned Na\\u2019vi leader Jake Sully (Sam Worthington) and Na\\u2019vi warrior Neytiri (Zoe Salda\\u00f1a), who have established a close-knit family and built a life with the ocean-dwelling Metkayina. But, their peace is threatened when they find themselves on a collision course with a deadly new Na\\u2019vi clan: the Mangkwan, also known as the Ash People.As with all AVATAR films, AVATAR: FIRE & ASH features all the things moviegoers have come to expect from a James Cameron film: thrilling action, grand spectacle, unforgettable characters who forge profound connections, and, most importantly, a story that will both move and inspire audiences around the globe.\\u00a0AVATAR: FIRE & ASH\\u00a0contains several sequences of bright lights which may affect customers who are susceptible to photosensitive epilepsy or other photo sensitivities.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Ll-acting-workshop-refocus-method\\/\",\"id\":\"542\",\"name\":\"Acting Workshop: ReFocus Method\",\"title\":\"Acting Workshop: ReFocus Method\",\"duration\":\"360 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1766188800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14163\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">10:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1766224800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1766188800],\"start_date\":\"1766224800\",\"end_date\":\"1766224800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ZHk5ankwMWNjN0VqVHJZUlgxMWpPUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 20 Dec 2025\",\"text\":\"ReFocus Method \\u2013 One Day IntensiveIn this one-day intensive, you\\u2019ll dive into acting as a craft through the ReFocus Method. Grounded in modern neuroscience,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.JPG\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/44\\/78343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx632\\/cy32\\/cw3110\\/ch3105\\/images\\/uploads\\/4478343dd194871e611ab90305e8fa90.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"ReFocus Method \\u2013 One Day IntensiveIn this one-day intensive, you\\u2019ll dive into acting as a craft through the ReFocus Method. Grounded in modern neuroscience, the method explores the connection between emotion and muscular tension, helping you handle mental noise and maintain focus in a clear, practical way. It provides tools not only for preparation but also for direct use in performance.The ReFocus Method encourages actors to remain curious and exploratory, finding ease rather than forcing or relying solely on psychological approaches. It challenges you to be concrete and clear in what you communicate. Originally developed in Sweden by Tony Grahn, building on the teachings of Andris Blekte, the method has since been refined into a hands-on craft.\\u00a0About Jasper de BruijnJasper de Bruijn is an acting coach from the Netherlands, where he teaches at the MA Film Acting programme in Amsterdam. He has extensive experience working across Europe and Africa, has trained in a wide range of acting techniques, and became a certified ReFocus Method teacher in 2018. He is currently co-developing a handbook on the ReFocus Method with Tony Grahn and pursuing research at the University of Birmingham to further anchor this approach.\\u00a0The WorkshopThis one-day intensive will be tailored to the needs of the group. The framework is the ReFocus Method, with space to take side steps where useful. You will begin with the basics of the approach and gradually build towards applying it in rehearsal, on stage, or on set.Participants are asked to prepare a monologue. This is not about delivering a perfect performance, but about having material to explore in practice \\u2014 ideally something you have not worked on before.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14163\\/\",\"search\":\"Acting Workshop: ReFocus Method Acting Workshop: ReFocus Method   <p><strong>ReFocus Method \\u2013 One Day Intensive<\\/strong><\\/p><p>In this one-day intensive, you\\u2019ll dive into acting as a craft through the ReFocus Method. Grounded in modern neuroscience, the method explores the connection between emotion and muscular tension, helping you handle mental noise and maintain focus in a clear, practical way. It provides tools not only for preparation but also for direct use in performance.<\\/p><p>The ReFocus Method encourages actors to remain curious and exploratory, finding ease rather than forcing or relying solely on psychological approaches. It challenges you to be concrete and clear in what you communicate. Originally developed in Sweden by Tony Grahn, building on the teachings of Andris Blekte, the method has since been refined into a hands-on craft.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About Jasper de Bruijn<\\/strong><br>Jasper de Bruijn is an acting coach from the Netherlands, where he teaches at the MA Film Acting programme in Amsterdam. He has extensive experience working across Europe and Africa, has trained in a wide range of acting techniques, and became a certified ReFocus Method teacher in 2018. He is currently co-developing a handbook on the ReFocus Method with Tony Grahn and pursuing research at the University of Birmingham to further anchor this approach.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>The Workshop<\\/strong><br>This one-day intensive will be tailored to the needs of the group. The framework is the ReFocus Method, with space to take side steps where useful. You will begin with the basics of the approach and gradually build towards applying it in rehearsal, on stage, or on set.<\\/p><p>Participants are asked to prepare a monologue. This is not about delivering a perfect performance, but about having material to explore in practice \\u2014 ideally something you have not worked on before.<\\/p> Acting Workshop: ReFocus Method  ReFocus Method \\u2013 One Day IntensiveIn this one-day intensive, you\\u2019ll dive into acting as a craft through the ReFocus Method. Grounded in modern neuroscience, the method explores the connection between emotion and muscular tension, helping you handle mental noise and maintain focus in a clear, practical way. It provides tools not only for preparation but also for direct use in performance.The ReFocus Method encourages actors to remain curious and exploratory, finding ease rather than forcing or relying solely on psychological approaches. It challenges you to be concrete and clear in what you communicate. Originally developed in Sweden by Tony Grahn, building on the teachings of Andris Blekte, the method has since been refined into a hands-on craft.\\u00a0About Jasper de BruijnJasper de Bruijn is an acting coach from the Netherlands, where he teaches at the MA Film Acting programme in Amsterdam. He has extensive experience working across Europe and Africa, has trained in a wide range of acting techniques, and became a certified ReFocus Method teacher in 2018. He is currently co-developing a handbook on the ReFocus Method with Tony Grahn and pursuing research at the University of Birmingham to further anchor this approach.\\u00a0The WorkshopThis one-day intensive will be tailored to the needs of the group. The framework is the ReFocus Method, with space to take side steps where useful. You will begin with the basics of the approach and gradually build towards applying it in rehearsal, on stage, or on set.Participants are asked to prepare a monologue. This is not about delivering a perfect performance, but about having material to explore in practice \\u2014 ideally something you have not worked on before.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1I-its-a-wonderful-life-4k-restoration\\/\",\"id\":\"594\",\"name\":\"It's a Wonderful Life (4K Restoration)\",\"title\":\"It's a Wonderful Life (4K Restoration)\",\"duration\":\"130 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":