75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/30\\/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6\\/w1673\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx432\\/cy6\\/cw1123\\/ch1120\\/images\\/uploads\\/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Get 20% off the adult price for any purchase of more than one ticket for our Christmas line-up:HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS: 25TH ANNIVERSARYLOVE ACTUALLY: 4K RESTORATIONIT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION\\u00a0IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION\\\"A crisis in housing, a racist ruling class and a struggle against a hideous ego-plutocrat who names everything after himself \\u2013 this 1946 classic still resonates\\\" - \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 GuardianSCREENING FROM A 4K RESTORATION...THE CHRISTMAS CLASSIC!Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey (James Stewart) finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve. Seeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge - but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him. Shocked by what he sees and at the unforeseen circumstances of his absence, George reconsiders and begs Clarence to return him to the problems of the present and the loving community he has fostered throughout his life.\\u00a0Ticketholders to our Christmas classics lineup this December can claim a free mince pie from the cinema foyer bar before the show! Applies to:LOVE ACTUALLYIT'S A WONDERFUL LIFEHOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"It's a Wonderful Life (4K Restoration) It's a Wonderful Life (4K Restoration)   <p>Get 20% off the adult price for any purchase of more than one ticket for our Christmas line-up:<\\/p><p><i>HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS: 25TH ANNIVERSARY<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>LOVE ACTUALLY: 4K RESTORATION<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><blockquote><p>\\\"A crisis in housing, a racist ruling class and a struggle against a hideous ego-plutocrat who names everything after himself \\u2013 this 1946 classic still resonates\\\" - \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 Guardian<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>SCREENING FROM A 4K RESTORATION...THE CHRISTMAS CLASSIC!<\\/p><p>Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey (James Stewart) finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve. Seeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge - but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him. Shocked by what he sees and at the unforeseen circumstances of his absence, George reconsiders and begs Clarence to return him to the problems of the present and the loving community he has fostered throughout his life.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Ticketholders to our Christmas classics lineup this December can claim a free mince pie from the cinema foyer bar before the show! Applies to:<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>LOVE ACTUALLY<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p><i><strong>HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p> It's a Wonderful Life (Scr 2),It's a Wonderful Life,It's a Wonderful Life (4K Restoration)  Get 20% off the adult price for any purchase of more than one ticket for our Christmas line-up:HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS: 25TH ANNIVERSARYLOVE ACTUALLY: 4K RESTORATIONIT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION\\u00a0IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION\\\"A crisis in housing, a racist ruling class and a struggle against a hideous ego-plutocrat who names everything after himself \\u2013 this 1946 classic still resonates\\\" - \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 \\u2605 GuardianSCREENING FROM A 4K RESTORATION...THE CHRISTMAS CLASSIC!Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey (James Stewart) finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve. Seeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge - but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him. Shocked by what he sees and at the unforeseen circumstances of his absence, George reconsiders and begs Clarence to return him to the problems of the present and the loving community he has fostered throughout his life.\\u00a0Ticketholders to our Christmas classics lineup this December can claim a free mince pie from the cinema foyer bar before the show! Applies to:LOVE ACTUALLYIT'S A WONDERFUL LIFEHOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LE-amore-jazz-world-music-night\\/\",\"id\":\"551\",\"name\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night\",\"title\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1766275200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"ta