s=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1780164000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1782514800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1782583200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1766275200,1768608000,1770422400,1772236800,1774051200,1776466800,1780095600,1782514800],\"start_date\":\"1766343600\",\"end_date\":\"1782583200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"YjlIN2pvSHdvNHNoOFR4VEthT0IxQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 21 Dec 2025 - Sat 27 Jun 2026\",\"text\":\"An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.Sunday 21 DecemberCHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2157\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d4\\/65ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570\\/w2157\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/images\\/uploads\\/d465ee7fdbaa5e7e789696a5bd784570.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.Sunday 21 DecemberCHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE NIGHT!!!!!!!!!\\u201c The Popular and hugely entertaining Riverside regular Tim Hain aka \\u201cthe King of Bleggae\\u201d ( blues reggae ) joins forces with the dynamic songstress and Mick Fleetwood protege Tallulah Bardens for a Christmas extravaganza. They will each perform and support each other \\u2018s original songs and meaningful covers from ballads to blues and boogie. It will be an evening of serious fun.\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ\\u00a0With Tim Hain\\u201cTimeless\\u201d\\u00a0 Tim\\u00a0 Hain is one of the UK\\u2019s finest \\u201cold school\\u201d blues guitarists, but he can\\u2019t\\u00a0 resist a bit of reggae. He is also a\\u00a0 compelling communicator and singer-songwriter. He has been called \\u201cThe Van Morrison of Blues-Reggae\\u201d by legendary producer Chris KIMSEY\\u00a0 who mixed Tim\\u2019s latest album \\u201cTales Of Timeless Tim\\u201d and produced both the Rolling Stones and reggae icons Peter Tosh and\\u00a0 Jimmy Cliff.Tim has performed at Riverside several times, always to a rousing reception. With powerhouse Chris Belshaw on Bass, and Tansay Omar ( Bjork, Boy George, Stereo MCs) on drums, this will be a stripped down, up-front\\u00a0 performance; \\u201cback to the roots\\u201d,\\u00a0 as Tim puts it, but all the more powerful for it.His single \\u201cSister Rosetta \\u201c was voted \\u201crecord of the week\\u201d on New Dawn Radio\\u2019s \\u201cJukebox Judgment\\u201d by top industry pros, , and made Mile Read\\u2019s Heritage Chart..Tim has played with the best on both sides of the Atlantic, touring and recording with reggae greats Tyrone Taylor, Winston Reedy, and Carroll Thompson, performing with Zakiya ( daughter of John Lee) Hooker and\\u00a0 even\\u00a0 jammed with Jeff Beck. He honed his craft fronting\\u00a0 2000 gigs since the turn of the century and is a natural performer, mixing songs and rhythms with which\\u00a0 you will be familiar, with his own stellar tunes\\u00a0Tallulah BardensKnown for her raw, electrifying energy across genres, from early blues to minimal techno, Tallulah Bardens\\u2019s style brings soulful storytelling to every stage she graces. With recent releases including Armada and Tomorrowland, her current writing and performance collaborations include jazz-house project with Chicago house legend Joe Smooth, trip-hop projects with her music collective Porcelain, and a starring contribution on official Fleetwood Mac tribute album Legacy, alongside Elton John and The Corrs among others.\\u00a0\\u00a0Tallulah continues to push creative boundaries through live blues collaborations with Tim Hain and new songwriting with Mick Fleetwood.Support ActSolur Jazz\\/Worldmusic Band Trio:with Peter Garvey(PHD Composer\\/Pianist),Henry Knudsen(Alto Sax) & Hide Takemoto(Guitar, UK Ambassador for Yamaha Music Corporation 2024 )\\u00a0World Music, Jazz, Latin Jazz\\u00a0 Solur Jazz Band presents a wide flavour of eclectic styles, showcasing the wide proliferation of Jazz and World Music.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Amore: Jazz & World Music Night Amore: Jazz & World Music Night   <p><strong>An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.<\\/strong><\\/p><h2><strong>Sunday 21 December<\\/strong><\\/h2><h3>CHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE NIGHT!!!!!!!!!<\\/h3><p>\\u201c The Popular and hugely entertaining Riverside regular Tim Hain aka \\u201cthe King of Bleggae\\u201d ( blues reggae ) joins forces with the dynamic songstress and Mick Fleetwood protege Tallulah Bardens for a Christmas extravaganza. They will each perform and support each other \\u2018s original songs and meaningful covers from ballads to blues and boogie. It will be an evening of serious fun.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><strong>https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>With Tim Hain<\\/strong><\\/p><p>\\u201cTimeless\\u201d&nbsp; Tim&nbsp; Hain is one of the UK\\u2019s finest \\u201cold school\\u201d blues guitarists, but he can\\u2019t&nbsp; resist a bit of reggae. He is also a&nbsp; compelling communicator and singer-songwriter. He has been called \\u201cThe Van Morrison of Blues-Reggae\\u201d by legendary producer Chris KIMSEY&nbsp; who mixed Tim\\u2019s latest album \\u201cTales Of Timeless Tim\\u201d and produced both the Rolling Stones and reggae icons Peter Tosh and&nbsp; Jimmy Cliff.<\\/p><p>Tim has performed at Riverside several times, always to a rousing reception. With powerhouse Chris Belshaw on Bass, and Tansay Omar ( Bjork, Boy George, Stereo MCs) on drums, this will be a stripped down, up-front&nbsp; performance; \\u201cback to the roots\\u201d,&nbsp; as Tim puts it, but all the more powerful for it.<\\/p><p>His single \\u201cSister Rosetta \\u201c was voted \\u201crecord of the week\\u201d on New Dawn Radio\\u2019s \\u201cJukebox Judgment\\u201d by top industry pros, , and made Mile Read\\u2019s Heritage Chart..<\\/p><p>Tim has played with the best on both sides of the Atlantic, touring and recording with reggae greats Tyrone Taylor, Winston Reedy, and Carroll Thompson, performing with Zakiya ( daughter of John Lee) Hooker and&nbsp; even&nbsp; jammed with Jeff Beck. He honed his craft fronting&nbsp; 2000 gigs since the turn of the century and is a natural performer, mixing songs and rhythms with which&nbsp; you will be familiar, with his own stellar tunes<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Tallulah Bardens<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Known for her raw, electrifying energy across genres, from early blues to minimal techno, Tallulah Bardens\\u2019s style brings soulful storytelling to every stage she graces. With recent releases including Armada and Tomorrowland, her current writing and performance collaborations include jazz-house project with Chicago house legend Joe Smooth, trip-hop projects with her music collective Porcelain, and a starring contribution on official Fleetwood Mac tribute album Legacy, alongside Elton John and The Corrs among others.&nbsp;&nbsp;Tallulah continues to push creative boundaries through live blues collaborations with Tim Hain and new songwriting with Mick Fleetwood.<\\/p><p><strong>Support Act<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Solur Jazz\\/Worldmusic Band Trio<\\/strong>:with Peter Garvey(PHD Composer\\/Pianist),Henry Knudsen(Alto Sax) &amp; Hide Takemoto(Guitar, UK Ambassador for Yamaha Music Corporation 2024 )<\\/p><p>&nbsp;World Music, Jazz, Latin Jazz&nbsp; Solur Jazz Band presents a wide flavour of eclectic styles, showcasing the wide proliferation of Jazz and World Music.<\\/p> Amore: Jazz & World Music Night  An always-eclectic line-up of jazz, funk and soul bands, singer-songwriters, poets and spoken word artists.Sunday 21 DecemberCHRISTMAS EXTRAVAGANZA BLEGGAE NIGHT!!!!!!!!!\\u201c The Popular and hugely entertaining Riverside regular Tim Hain aka \\u201cthe King of Bleggae\\u201d ( blues reggae ) joins forces with the dynamic songstress and Mick Fleetwood protege Tallulah Bardens for a Christmas extravaganza. They will each perform and support each other \\u2018s original songs and meaningful covers from ballads to blues and boogie. It will be an evening of serious fun.\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=J_txt8ZymhQ\\u00a0With Tim Hain\\u201cTimeless\\u201d\\u00a0 Tim\\u00a0 Hain is one of the UK\\u2019s finest \\u201cold school\\u201d blues guitarists, but he can\\u2019t\\u00a0 resist a bit of reggae. He is also a\\u00a0 compelling communicator and singer-songwriter. He has been called \\u201cThe Van Morrison of Blues-Reggae\\u201d by legendary producer Chris KIMSEY\\u00a0 who mixed Tim\\u2019s latest album \\u201cTales Of Timeless Tim\\u201d and produced both the Rolling Stones and reggae icons Peter Tosh and\\u00a0 Jimmy Cliff.Tim has performed at Riverside several times, always to a rousing reception. With powerhouse Chris Belshaw on Bass, and Tansay Omar ( Bjork, Boy George, Stereo MCs) on drums, this will be a stripped down, up-front\\u00a0 performance; \\u201cback to the roots\\u201d,\\u00a0 as Tim puts it, but all the more powerful for it.His single \\u201cSister Rosetta \\u201c was voted \\u201crecord of the week\\u201d on New Dawn Radio\\u2019s \\u201cJukebox Judgment\\u201d by top industry pros, , and made Mile Read\\u2019s Heritage Chart..Tim has played with the best on both sides of the Atlantic, touring and recording with reggae greats Tyrone Taylor, Winston Reedy, and Carroll Thompson, performing with Zakiya ( daughter of John Lee) Hooker and\\u00a0 even\\u00a0 jammed with Jeff Beck. He honed his craft fronting\\u00a0 2000 gigs since the turn of the century and is a natural performer, mixing songs and rhythms with which\\u00a0 you will be familiar, with his own stellar tunes\\u00a0Tallulah BardensKnown for her raw, electrifying energy across genres, from early blues to minimal techno, Tallulah Bardens\\u2019s style brings soulful storytelling to every stage she graces. With recent releases including Armada and Tomorrowland, her current writing and performance collaborations include jazz-house project with Chicago house legend Joe Smooth, trip-hop projects with her music collective Porcelain, and a starring contribution on official Fleetwood Mac tribute album Legacy, alongside Elton John and The Corrs among others.\\u00a0\\u00a0Tallulah continues to push creative boundaries through live blues collaborations with Tim Hain and new songwriting with Mick Fleetwood.Support ActSolur Jazz\\/Worldmusic Band Trio:with Peter Garvey(PHD Composer\\/Pianist),Henry Knudsen(Alto Sax) & Hide Takemoto(Guitar, UK Ambassador for Yamaha Music Corporation 2024 )\\u00a0World Music, Jazz, Latin Jazz\\u00a0 Solur Jazz Band presents a wide flavour of eclectic styles, showcasing the wide proliferation of Jazz and World Music.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1h-marty-supreme\\/\",\"id\":\"619\",\"name\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"title\":\"Marty Supreme\",\"duration\":\"149 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1767225600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/24604\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:10<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767298200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1767312000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/25201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:10<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767384600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1767398400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/24605\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:10<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767471000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1767484800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22605\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:10<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767557400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1767571200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22606\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:10<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1767643800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1767657600\"