enings on the same weekend!Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR.For the first time, experience Volumes 1 & 2 seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.\\u00a0Includes a 15 minute intermission.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair   <h2>For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!<\\/h2><p>Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with <i><strong>KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR<\\/strong><\\/i>.<\\/p><p>For the first time, experience <strong>Volumes 1 &amp; 2 <\\/strong>seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Includes a 15 minute intermission.<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p> Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair  For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR.For the first time, experience Volumes 1 & 2 seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.\\u00a0Includes a 15 minute intermission.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/bJ-once-upon-a-time-in-hollywood-qa\\/\",\"id\":\"644\",\"name\":\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A\",\"title\":\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A\",\"duration\":\"155 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768003200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14615\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">17:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768064400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768003200],\"start_date\":\"1768064400\",\"end_date\":\"1768064400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"d3BYcHZUbnBnNC9DMUhwWW1MWG9LQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 10 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/59\\/2903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317\\/w1280\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx185\\/cy9\\/cw846\\/ch844\\/images\\/uploads\\/592903306a9fa84181417af8e483f317.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood - following a screening of the acclaimed film from director Quentin Tarantino. Copies of the book will be available in the cinema foyer during the event.For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A \\u00a0on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!\\u00a0The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood by JAY GLENNIE, OUT NOW FROM TITAN BOOKSFor the first time ever Academy Award-winning filmmaker Quentin Tarantino has granted renowned and respected journalist and author Jay Glennie (One Shot: The Making of Deer Hunter, Raging Bull: The Making of) unique access revealing the never-before-told behind-the-scenes making of one of the most iconic films of all time, Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood.Jay Glennie brings his expertise, experience, and incisive writing to this unique volume, pulling back the curtain on the visionary writer\\/director\\/producer\\u2019s ninth film, with unprecedented access to the filmmaker, cast, and crew. This epic tome is a stunning and faithful deep dive into the mind of a masterful auteur and a must-have book for all film lovers and Quentin Tarantino fans.\\u00a0Quentin Tarantino personally introduces the volume, as well as providing hundreds of behind-the-scenes photographs, along with production memos, concept art, and costume and production design sketches. There are also exclusive reproductions of letters, studio documents and film ephemera. The result is an official record of how it was achieved, from inception to the world premiere and on to ten Academy Award nominations, resulting in two Oscars.The book includes new and exclusive interviews undertaken by Jay Glennie with key cast and crew members, including Oscar winning actors Leonardo DiCaprio and Brad Pitt, Oscar nominee Margot Robbie, and the brilliant supporting cast including Oscar winner Mikey Madison, Margaret Qualley, Oscar nominee Austin Butler, Lena Dunham, Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Emile Hirsch, Damian Lewis, Maya Hawke, and Sydney Sweeney.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14615\\/\",\"search\":\"Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A   <p><strong>We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood - following a screening of the acclaimed film from director Quentin Tarantino. Copies of the book will be available in the cinema foyer during the event.<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A &nbsp;on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood<\\/strong><\\/i> by JAY GLENNIE, OUT NOW FROM <strong>TITAN BOOKS<\\/strong><\\/p><p>For the first time ever Academy Award-winning filmmaker Quentin Tarantino has granted renowned and respected journalist and author Jay Glennie (<i>One Shot: The Making of Deer Hunter<\\/i>, <i>Raging Bull: The Making of<\\/i>) unique access revealing the never-before-told behind-the-scenes making of one of the most iconic films of all time, Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood.<\\/p><p>Jay Glennie brings his expertise, experience, and incisive writing to this unique volume, pulling back the curtain on the visionary writer\\/director\\/producer\\u2019s ninth film, with unprecedented access to the filmmaker, cast, and crew. This epic tome is a stunning and faithful deep dive into the mind of a masterful auteur and a must-have book for all film lovers and Quentin Tarantino fans.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Quentin Tarantino personally introduces the volume, as well as providing hundreds of behind-the-scenes photographs, along with production memos, concept art, and costume and production design sketches. There are also exclusive reproductions of letters, studio documents and film ephemera. The result is an official record of how it was achieved, from inception to the world premiere and on to ten Academy Award nominations, resulting in two Oscars.<\\/p><p>The book includes new and exclusive interviews undertaken by Jay Glennie with key cast and crew members, including Oscar winning actors Leonardo DiCaprio and Brad Pitt, Oscar nominee Margot Robbie, and the brilliant supporting cast including Oscar winner Mikey Madison, Margaret Qualley, Oscar nominee Austin Butler, Lena Dunham, Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Emile Hirsch, Damian Lewis, Maya Hawke, and Sydney Sweeney.<\\/p> Once Upon a Time in Hollywood + Q&A  We are delighted to welcome author Jay Glennie to Riverside to discuss his new book - The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood - following a screening of the acclaimed film from director Quentin Tarantino. Copies of the book will be available in the cinema foyer during the event.For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&A \\u00a0on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!\\u00a0The Making of Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s Once Upon a Time in Hollywood by JAY GLENNIE, OUT NOW FROM TITAN BOOKSFor the first time ever Academy Award-winning filmmaker Quentin Tarantino has granted renowned and respected journalist and author Jay Glennie (One Shot: The Making of Deer Hunter, Raging Bull: The Making of) unique access revealing the never-before-told behind-the-scenes making of one of the most iconic films of all time, Once Upon a Time... in Hollywood.Jay Glennie brings his expertise, experience, and incisive writing to this unique volume, pulling back the curtain on the visionary writer\\/director\\/producer\\u2019s ninth film, with unprecedented access to the filmmaker, cast, and crew. This epic tome is a stunning and faithful deep dive into the mind of a masterful auteur and a must-have book for all film lovers and Quentin Tarantino fans.\\u00a0Quentin Tarantino personally introduces the volume, as well as providing hundreds of behind-the-scenes photographs, along with production memos, concept art, and costume and production design sketches. There are also exclusive reproductions of letters, studio documents and film ephemera. The result is an official record of how it was achieved, from inception to the world premiere and on to ten Academy Award nominations, resulting in two Oscars.The book includes new and exclusive interviews undertaken by Jay Glennie with key cast and crew members, including Oscar winning actors Leonardo DiCaprio and Brad Pitt, Oscar nominee Margot Robbie, and the brilliant supporting cast including Oscar winner Mikey Madison, Margaret Qualley, Oscar nominee Austin Butler, Lena Dunham, Kurt Russell, Dakota Fanning, Emile Hirsch, Damian Lewis, Maya Hawke, and Sydney Sweeney.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/LY-beaded-jewellery-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"556\",\"name\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop\",\"title\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768089600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14667\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768140000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768694400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/25003\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768744800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768089600,1768694400],\"start_date\":\"1768140000\",\"end_date\":\"1768744800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"NFhiZC8wdTZuTzN1elpwdktsTzEvUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 11 - Sun 18 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?&nbsp;Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6c\\/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx649\\/cw3017\\/ch3011\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?\\u00a0Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?\\u00a0This could be the workshop for you.\\u00a0This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.\\u00a0Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!\\u00a0About Clair GreenClair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.\\u00a0Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of Portobello Market, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop Beaded Jewellery Workshop   <p><i>Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?&nbsp;<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>This could be the workshop for you.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About Clair Green<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Clair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of <strong>Portobello Market<\\/strong>, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.<\\/p> Beaded Jewellery Workshop  Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?\\u00a0Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?\\u00a0This could be the workshop for you.\\u00a0This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.\\u00a0Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!\\u00a0About Clair GreenClair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.\\u00a0Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of Portobello Market, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gW-the-seat-of-me\\/\",\"id\":\"955\",\"name\":\"The Seat of Me\",\"title\":\"The Seat of Me\",\"duration\":\"60 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768262400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/29401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768331700\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1768348800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/29601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:15<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768418100\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768262400,1768348800],\"start_date\":\"1768331700\",\"end_date\":\"1768418100\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RFVtUWhNMWpLS1RHTjFXcVhmQWJmdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 13 - Wed 14 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"The Seat of Me is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cb\\/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b\\/w1587\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx351\\/cy5\\/cw1033\\/ch1032\\/images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"The Seat of Me is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried\\u2014unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: Am I enough?Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf\\u2019s music, The Seat of Me reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"The Seat of Me The Seat of Me   <p><i>The Seat of Me <\\/i>is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.<\\/p><p>Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried\\u2014unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.<\\/p><p>Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: <i>Am I enough?<\\/i><\\/p><p>Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf\\u2019s music, <i>The Seat of Me <\\/i>reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become.<\\/p> The Seat of Me  The Seat of Me is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried\\u2014unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: Am I enough?Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf\\u2019s music, The Seat of Me reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gQ-for-us-by-us-workshop-series\\/\",\"id\":\"970\",\"name\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series\",\"title\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768435200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31601\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768500000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1772668800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31801\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772733600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1775689200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1775754000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1778194800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/32001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1778259600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768435200,1772668800,1775689200,1778194800],\"start_date\":\"1768500000\",\"end_date\":\"1778259600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"Sm9lUkxkejZzcW8rVk9BWTZDQnZ3dz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 15 Jan - Fri 8 May 2026\",\"text\":\"Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.&nbsp;\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/a7\\/dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f\\/w1024\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx162\\/cy7\\/cw677\\/ch676\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.\\u00a0\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES\\u00a0For Us, By Us is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the Burnt Orange Youth Board. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.\\u00a0Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.\\u00a0\\u00a0What to expect\\u00a0The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.\\u00a0Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.\\u00a0\\u00a0Why youth-led matters\\u00a0The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes For Us, By Us immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.\\u00a0Burnt Orange Theatre is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.\\u00a0\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025\\u00a0Don\\u2019t miss out - join For Us, By Us and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series For Us, By Us: Workshop Series   <p>Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d<\\/i> \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>For Us, By Us<\\/strong> is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the <strong>Burnt Orange Youth Board<\\/strong>. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>What to expect&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Why youth-led matters&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes <strong>For Us, By Us<\\/strong> immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Burnt Orange Theatre<\\/strong> is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d<\\/i> \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Don\\u2019t miss out - join <strong>For Us, By Us<\\/strong> and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement.<\\/p> For Us, By Us: Workshop Series  Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.\\u00a0\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES\\u00a0For Us, By Us is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the Burnt Orange Youth Board. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.\\u00a0Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.\\u00a0\\u00a0What to expect\\u00a0The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.\\u00a0\\u00b7\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u00a0 Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.\\u00a0Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.\\u00a0\\u00a0Why youth-led matters\\u00a0The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes For Us, By Us immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.\\u00a0Burnt Orange Theatre is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.\\u00a0\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025\\u00a0Don\\u2019t miss out - join For Us, By Us and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gp-hanging-plant-holder-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"972\",\"name\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop\",\"title\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768608000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31001\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768647600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768608000],\"start_date\":\"1768647600\",\"end_date\":\"1768647600\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"UkJiWXdmNStnSHRiU2tGVkhyWTRmZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 17 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/b4\\/5a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb\\/w1006\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx37\\/cy395\\/cw938\\/ch939\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!\\u00a0 Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.\\u00a0 Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.\\u00a0This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!\\u00a0 No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!\\u00a0 Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!\\u00a0\\u00a0About CURATE & MORE\\u00a0Curate & More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.\\u00a0 Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!\\u00a0To find out more about CURATE & MORE events and services visit our website here\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31001\\/\",\"search\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop Hanging Plant Holder Workshop   <p>What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!<\\/p><p>In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!&nbsp; Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.&nbsp; Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!&nbsp; No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!&nbsp; Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!<\\/p><p><strong>&nbsp;<\\/strong>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>About CURATE &amp; MORE&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/p><p>Curate &amp; More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.&nbsp; Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;To find out more about CURATE &amp; MORE events and services visit our website <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.curateandmore.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\"><strong>here&nbsp;<\\/strong><\\/a><\\/p> Hanging Plant Holder Workshop  What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!\\u00a0 Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.\\u00a0 Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.\\u00a0This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!\\u00a0 No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!\\u00a0 Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!\\u00a0\\u00a0About CURATE & MORE\\u00a0Curate & More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.\\u00a0 Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!\\u00a0To find out more about CURATE & MORE events and services visit our website here\\u00a0\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gn-young-riverscribes\\/\",\"id\":\"943\",\"name\":\"Young Riverscribes\",\"title\":\"Young Riverscribes\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768694400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14826\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768734000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1769904000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15076\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769943600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1771113600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22205\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1771153200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1772323200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22004\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772362800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1773532800\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23417\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1773572400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1774742400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/24202\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">11:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1774778400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768694400,1769904000,1771113600,1772323200,1773532800,1774742400],\"start_date\":\"1768734000\",\"end_date\":\"1774778400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"OEM3ZG90QlVDVVUxWE1XRnlPK1hWdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 18 Jan - Sun 29 Mar 2026\",\"text\":\"Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac