ustom\\/d5\\/b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx609\\/cw3444\\/ch3439\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.\\u00a0At the heart of the project is Demystify, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.\\u00a0Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:\\u00a0\\u25cf Performing scripted work\\u00a0\\u25cf Writing and devising\\u00a0\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership\\u00a0\\u25cf Screen acting skills\\u00a0\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities\\u00a0\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore\\u00a0\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.\\u00a0If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at burntorange.theatre@gmail.com.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024\\u00a0Ready to take the leap? Book your place in Young Riverscribes today and start building your creative future.\\u00a0\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Young Riverscribes Young Riverscribes   <h3>Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.<\\/h3><blockquote><p>\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre&nbsp;<\\/p><\\/blockquote><p><strong>Young Riverscribes <\\/strong>is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>At the heart of the project is <strong>Demystify<\\/strong>, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&amp;As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Performing scripted work&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Writing and devising&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Screen acting skills&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at <a href=\\\"mailto:burntorange.theatre@gmail.com\\\"><strong>burntorange.theatre@gmail.com<\\/strong><\\/a>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d<\\/i> \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Ready to take the leap? Book your place in <strong>Young Riverscribes <\\/strong>today and start building your creative future.&nbsp;<\\/p> Young Riverscribes  Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.\\u00a0At the heart of the project is Demystify, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.\\u00a0Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:\\u00a0\\u25cf Performing scripted work\\u00a0\\u25cf Writing and devising\\u00a0\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership\\u00a0\\u25cf Screen acting skills\\u00a0\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities\\u00a0\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore\\u00a0\\u00a0Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.\\u00a0If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at burntorange.theatre@gmail.com.\\u00a0\\u00a0\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024\\u00a0Ready to take the leap? Book your place in Young Riverscribes today and start building your creative future.\\u00a0\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/g6-writing-dialogue\\/\",\"id\":\"977\",\"name\":\"Writing Dialogue\",\"title\":\"Writing Dialogue\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1768694400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31201\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1768741200\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1768694400],\"start_date\":\"1768741200\",\"end_date\":\"1768741200\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"emM3RTF3bWhuUzRlWHZHRXJ2b2haZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 18 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Nick DawkinsThis workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/ff\\/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx182\\/cy30\\/cw2487\\/ch2485\\/images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Nick DawkinsThis workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.\\u00a0Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, A Manchester Anthem, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31201\\/\",\"search\":\"Writing Dialogue Writing Dialogue   <p><i><strong>Led by Nick Dawkins<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>This workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.<\\/p><p>All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, <i><strong>A Manchester Anthem<\\/strong><\\/i>, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre.<\\/p> Writing Dialogue  Led by Nick DawkinsThis workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.\\u00a0Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, A Manchester Anthem, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1B-introduction-to-puppetry-workshop\\/\",\"id\":\"587\",\"name\":\"Introduction to Puppetry Workshop\",\"title\":\"Introduction to Puppetry Workshop\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769040000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14886\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">18:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769104800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769040000],\"start_date\":\"1769104800\",\"end_date\":\"1769104800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"ZHZHUFRzZE1YTit4ZUtIWmxsSEtzdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 22 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"The Horgles are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with Oliver Award Winning Irish theatre company Fishamble and have&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/88\\/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63\\/w1366\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx55\\/cw770\\/ch768\\/images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"The Horgles are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with Oliver Award Winning Irish theatre company Fishamble and have collaborated with Theatre Deli, New Diorama, Theatre503 and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre.\\u00a0Ceilb\\u00ed is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show A Xerox of a Deer was a smash hit at Edinburgh Fringe in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!\\u00a0Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a BBC top 1% writer for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.\\u00a0\\u00a0In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.\\u00a0We perform with \\u2018Muppet-Style\\u2019 puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.At the end of this Introduction to Puppetry workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14886\\/\",\"search\":\"Introduction to Puppetry Workshop Introduction to Puppetry Workshop   <p><strong>The Horgles<\\/strong> are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with <strong>Oliver Award Winning<\\/strong> Irish theatre company <strong>Fishamble <\\/strong>and have collaborated with <strong>Theatre Deli<\\/strong>, <strong>New Diorama<\\/strong>,<strong> Theatre503 <\\/strong>and <strong>Camden People\\u2019s Theatre<\\/strong>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Ceilb\\u00ed is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show <i>A Xerox of a Deer<\\/i> was a smash hit at<strong> Edinburgh Fringe<\\/strong> in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a <strong>BBC top 1% writer<\\/strong> for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>We perform with \\u2018Muppet-Style\\u2019 puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.<\\/p><p>At the end of this <strong>Introduction to Puppetry<\\/strong> workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up.<\\/p> Introduction to Puppetry Workshop  The Horgles are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilb\\u00ed. They have worked with Oliver Award Winning Irish theatre company Fishamble and have collaborated with Theatre Deli, New Diorama, Theatre503 and Camden People\\u2019s Theatre.\\u00a0Ceilb\\u00ed is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show A Xerox of a Deer was a smash hit at Edinburgh Fringe in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!\\u00a0Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a BBC top 1% writer for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.\\u00a0\\u00a0In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.\\u00a0We perform with \\u2018Muppet-Style\\u2019 puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.At the end of this Introduction to Puppetry workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/b9-national-theatre-live-hamlet\\/\",\"id\":\"634\",\"name\":\"National Theatre Live: Hamlet\",\"title\":\"National Theatre Live: Hamlet\",\"duration\":\"120 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769040000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14896\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769108400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769040000],\"start_date\":\"1769108400\",\"end_date\":\"1769108400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"U2hYcnMrdlJ2d1RNVFh1Q0hVQkR5dz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Thu 22 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"HamletBy William ShakespeareDirected by Robert Hastie&nbsp;Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/1c\\/220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1\\/w1240\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/cx54\\/cy33\\/cw632\\/ch633\\/images\\/uploads\\/1c220b60a35371a4509ff54b833fd3c1.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"HamletBy William ShakespeareDirected by Robert Hastie\\u00a0Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare\\u2019s famous tragedy.Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question \\u2013 you know the one.National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky\\u2019s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14896\\/\",\"search\":\"National Theatre Live: Hamlet National Theatre Live: Hamlet   <p><strong>Hamlet<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>By William Shakespeare<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Directed by Robert Hastie<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Olivier Award-winner <\\/strong>Hiran Abeysekera (<i>Life of Pi<\\/i>) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare\\u2019s famous tragedy.<\\/p><p>Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question \\u2013 you know the one.<\\/p><p>National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (<i>Standing at the Sky\\u2019s Edge<\\/i>, <i>Operation Mincemeat<\\/i>) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.<\\/p> National Theatre Live: Hamlet  HamletBy William ShakespeareDirected by Robert Hastie\\u00a0Olivier Award-winner Hiran Abeysekera (Life of Pi) is Hamlet in this fearless, contemporary take on Shakespeare\\u2019s famous tragedy.Trapped between duty and doubt, surrounded by power and privilege, young Prince Hamlet dares to ask the ultimate question \\u2013 you know the one.National Theatre Deputy Artistic Director, Robert Hastie (Standing at the Sky\\u2019s Edge, Operation Mincemeat) directs this sharp, stylish and darkly funny reimagining.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/9X-the-self-producing-artist\\/\",\"id\":\"919\",\"name\":\"The Self-Producing Artist\",\"title\":\"The Self-Producing Artist\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769299200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14942\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769346000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769299200],\"start_date\":\"1769346000\",\"end_date\":\"1769346000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"bDBIdnRyQ0xadkQ3TkJ0SlhpdkFoZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sun 25 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Arielle ZilkhaLed by Psychonaut\\u2019s Managing Director, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/3d\\/44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae\\/w1466\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx20\\/cy54\\/cw1446\\/ch1446\\/images\\/uploads\\/3d44b235625af496d8ce5d1e4f896dae.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Arielle ZilkhaLed by Psychonaut\\u2019s Managing Director, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the role of producer and take strategic control of their work. The session will reframe your artistic practice through a producer\\u2019s lens, covering how to build a sustainable creative ecosystem around your work, whether you operate independently or as a company. You\\u2019ll gain practical insight into developing a clear artistic identity supported by a strong branding and production strategy.\\u00a0We\\u2019ll explore essential producing skills such as building strategic partnerships, carving out your niche, strengthening your project pipeline, and raising your profile through targeted marketing and PR. The workshop blends hands-on exercises, reflective tasks, and open discussions. By the end, you\\u2019ll walk away with actionable tools and strategies, and a clearer roadmap for developing a distinctive, professional presence within London\\u2019s cultural landscape.\\u00a0\\u00a0Arielle Zilkha is the Founder and Managing Director of Psychonaut Theatre, an international hub for performance artists, which she founded in 2021. She works as a multidisciplinary producer, theatre-maker, performer and composer across the London and international fringe scene, having trained on BA Acting and Performance at Wimbledon College of Arts and MA Advanced Theatre Practice at Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. She has produced and performed in Psychonaut productions in venues such as Tate Britain, The Koppel Project, Camden People\\u2019s Theatre and Riverside Studios.Her producing practice sees her bring international productions to London, working with organisations such as the Nordisk Teaterlaboratorium (Denmark). As the director of Psychonaut, she strives to create a space for international performance practices to be explored and for an alternative performance scene to thrive in the U.K.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14942\\/\",\"search\":\"The Self-Producing Artist The Self-Producing Artist   <p><i><strong>Led by Arielle Zilkha<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Led by Psychonaut\\u2019s <strong>Managing Director<\\/strong>, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the role of producer and take strategic control of their work. The session will reframe your artistic practice through a producer\\u2019s lens, covering how to build a sustainable creative ecosystem around your work, whether you operate independently or as a company. You\\u2019ll gain practical insight into developing a clear artistic identity supported by a strong branding and production strategy.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>We\\u2019ll explore essential producing skills such as building strategic partnerships, carving out your niche, strengthening your project pipeline, and raising your profile through targeted marketing and PR. The workshop blends hands-on exercises, reflective tasks, and open discussions. By the end, you\\u2019ll walk away with actionable tools and strategies, and a clearer roadmap for developing a distinctive, professional presence within London\\u2019s cultural landscape.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>Arielle Zilkha <\\/strong><\\/i>is the Founder and Managing Director of <strong>Psychonaut Theatre<\\/strong>, an international hub for performance artists, which she founded in 2021. She works as a multidisciplinary producer, theatre-maker, performer and composer across the London and international fringe scene, having trained on BA Acting and Performance at Wimbledon College of Arts and MA Advanced Theatre Practice at Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. She has produced and performed in Psychonaut productions in venues such as Tate Britain, The Koppel Project, Camden People\\u2019s Theatre and Riverside Studios.<\\/p><p>Her producing practice sees her bring international productions to London, working with organisations such as the Nordisk Teaterlaboratorium (Denmark). As the director of Psychonaut, she strives to create a space for international performance practices to be explored and for an alternative performance scene to thrive in the U.K.<\\/p> The Self-Producing Artist  Led by Arielle ZilkhaLed by Psychonaut\\u2019s Managing Director, Arielle Zilkha, this workshop is designed for artists at any level who want to step into the role of producer and take strategic control of their work. The session will reframe your artistic practice through a producer\\u2019s lens, covering how to build a sustainable creative ecosystem around your work, whether you operate independently or as a company. You\\u2019ll gain practical insight into developing a clear artistic identity supported by a strong branding and production strategy.\\u00a0We\\u2019ll explore essential producing skills such as building strategic partnerships, carving out your niche, strengthening your project pipeline, and raising your profile through targeted marketing and PR. The workshop blends hands-on exercises, reflective tasks, and open discussions. By the end, you\\u2019ll walk away with actionable tools and strategies, and a clearer roadmap for developing a distinctive, professional presence within London\\u2019s cultural landscape.\\u00a0\\u00a0Arielle Zilkha is the Founder and Managing Director of Psychonaut Theatre, an international hub for performance artists, which she founded in 2021. She works as a multidisciplinary producer, theatre-maker, performer and composer across the London and international fringe scene, having trained on BA Acting and Performance at Wimbledon College of Arts and MA Advanced Theatre Practice at Royal Central School of Speech and Drama. She has produced and performed in Psychonaut productions in venues such as Tate Britain, The Koppel Project, Camden People\\u2019s Theatre and Riverside Studios.Her producing practice sees her bring international productions to London, working with organisations such as the Nordisk Teaterlaboratorium (Denmark). As the director of Psychonaut, she strives to create a space for international performance practices to be explored and for an alternative performance scene to thrive in the U.K.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/b2-queer-poetry-open-mic-night\\/\",\"id\":\"670\",\"name\":\"Queer Poetry Open Mic Night\",\"title\":\"Queer Poetry Open Mic Night\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769472000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14982\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769540400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769472000],\"start_date\":\"1769540400\",\"end_date\":\"1769540400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"VktQTFRCUlNRNEFlRllhNUgyUEdQZz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 27 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Hey there! We are collaborating with S-BARS to bring you a Queer Poetry Open Mic night!&nbsp;Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience!&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a1604