\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/74\\/15253382a160490cb50937855cd909\\/w1352\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx54\\/cy200\\/cw1220\\/ch1220\\/images\\/uploads\\/7415253382a160490cb50937855cd909.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Hey there! We are collaborating with S-BARS to bring you a Queer Poetry Open Mic night!\\u00a0Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience! OR come along and listen to lots of wonderful poets sharing their art!\\u00a06:30pm: Doors7:00pm: Event starts10:00pm: Event finishes\\u00a0\\u00a0Please note there are open mic slots available for purchase\\u00a0online\\u00a0and there will be a limited amount of\\u00a0sign up spaces on the door!\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/14982\\/\",\"search\":\"Queer Poetry Open Mic Night Queer Poetry Open Mic Night   <p>Hey there! We are collaborating with <strong>S-BARS <\\/strong>to bring you a <strong>Queer Poetry Open Mic night<\\/strong>!&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience! OR come along and listen to lots of wonderful poets sharing their art!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>6:30pm: Doors<\\/p><p>7:00pm: Event starts<\\/p><p>10:00pm: Event finishes&nbsp;<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Please note there are open mic slots available for purchase<strong>&nbsp;online<\\/strong>&nbsp;and there will be a <strong>limited amount <\\/strong>of&nbsp;sign up spaces on the door!<\\/i><\\/p> Queer Poetry Open Mic Night  Hey there! We are collaborating with S-BARS to bring you a Queer Poetry Open Mic night!\\u00a0Bring your poems and perform for a supportive and kind audience! OR come along and listen to lots of wonderful poets sharing their art!\\u00a06:30pm: Doors7:00pm: Event starts10:00pm: Event finishes\\u00a0\\u00a0Please note there are open mic slots available for purchase\\u00a0online\\u00a0and there will be a limited amount of\\u00a0sign up spaces on the door!\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/g0-london-short-film-festival-showcase-palestine-looks-back\\/\",\"id\":\"974\",\"name\":\"London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back\",\"title\":\"London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back\",\"duration\":\"104 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769731200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31401\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">20:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769805000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769731200],\"start_date\":\"1769805000\",\"end_date\":\"1769805000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"WjVuWm5uZHVqeERyUE1WSGhuQU5BUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Fri 30 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/0c\\/3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970\\/w1600\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx156\\/cy5\\/cw886\\/ch884\\/images\\/uploads\\/0c3fbe83ebdbd5a58b891a5913633970.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.\\u00a0The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway \\/ Palestine 2013, 20minsIt's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16minsNachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 minsElefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9minsThey Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4minsWe began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins\\u00a0Contains themes of death and injury.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/31401\\/\",\"search\":\"London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back   <p><i>Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway \\/ Palestine 2013, 20mins<\\/p><p>It's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16mins<\\/p><p>Nachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 mins<\\/p><p>Elefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9mins<\\/p><p>They Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4mins<\\/p><p>We began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Contains themes of death and injury.<\\/p> London Short Film Festival Showcase: Palestine Looks Back  Palestinian voices who dared to go beyond what was asked, turning their gaze back on the West - its inaction, border regimes, colonial history, but also its solidarity and environment.This programme is curated by Theo Panagopoulos.\\u00a0The Goodness Regime, dir. Jumana Manna and Sille Storihle, Norway \\/ Palestine 2013, 20minsIt's a long way from Amphioxus, dir. Kamal Aljafari, Germany 2019, 16minsNachbarn (Neighbours), dir. Pary El-Qalqili and Christiane Schmidt, Germany 2018, 26 minsElefsina Notre Amour, dir. Mahdi Fleifel, Greece 2023, 9minsThey Live in Forests, They are Extremely Shy, dir. Saeed Taji Farouky, UK 2016, 4minsWe began by measuring distance, dir. Basma Alsharif, Egypt 2009, 19mins\\u00a0Contains themes of death and injury.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/b1-mime-principles\\/\",\"id\":\"629\",\"name\":\"Mime Principles\",\"title\":\"Mime Principles\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769817600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15052\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">13:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769864400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769817600],\"start_date\":\"1769864400\",\"end_date\":\"1769864400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"L0JDbUQwbjE5MWVFcjJIWldOaDFxdz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 31 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation,&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/6a\\/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpeg\\/cx254\\/cy945\\/cw2517\\/ch2519\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.\\u00a0All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.\\u00a0Francesca Fatichenti is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre.\\u00a0Tom Parry is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15052\\/\",\"search\":\"Mime Principles Mime Principles   <p><i><strong>Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom Perry<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>This workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.&nbsp;<\\/p><p>All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Francesca Fatichenti<\\/strong> is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the <strong>Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre<\\/strong>.&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Tom Parry<\\/strong> is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.<\\/p> Mime Principles  Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.\\u00a0All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.\\u00a0Francesca Fatichenti is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre.\\u00a0Tom Parry is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/1J-hancocks-half-hour-triple-bill-part-xi\\/\",\"id\":\"582\",\"name\":\"Hancock's Half Hour Triple Bill: Part XI\",\"title\":\"Hancock's Half Hour Triple Bill: Part XI\",\"duration\":\"150 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769817600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15060\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">14:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769868000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769817600],\"start_date\":\"1769868000\",\"end_date\":\"1769868000\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"RStJVzNTZWF2eklMMXlycHFqNGkwQT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 31 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Proudly presented as part of our MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.JPG\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/63\\/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9\\/w682\\/q80\\/wpoJPG\\/cx110\\/cw554\\/ch553\\/images\\/uploads\\/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Proudly presented as part of our MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue our longstanding celebration of the inimitable Tony Hancock, with a further three episodes of Hancock's classic work. The Tony Hancock Appreciation Society will introduce and discuss the episode afterwards as usual.\\u00a0Episodes:Hancock's Half Hour: The New Nose (Made at Riverside)Hancock (1963 ATV Series): The Eye WitnessHancock: The Bedsitter\\u00a0With thanks to our collaborators on this event, the Tony Hancock Appreciation Society, the estates of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson, the estate of Tony Hancock, and the British Film Institute.\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15060\\/\",\"search\":\"Hancock's Half Hour Triple Bill: Part XI Hancock's Half Hour Triple Bill: Part XI   <p>Proudly presented as part of our <strong>MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV<\\/strong> strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue our longstanding celebration of the inimitable Tony Hancock, with a further three episodes of Hancock's classic work.<strong> The Tony Hancock Appreciation Society<\\/strong> will introduce and discuss the episode afterwards as usual.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Episodes:<\\/p><p><i>Hancock's Half Hour: The New Nose (Made at Riverside)<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>Hancock (1963 ATV Series): The Eye Witness<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>Hancock: The Bedsitter<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>With thanks to our collaborators on this event, the <strong>Tony Hancock Appreciation Society,<\\/strong> the estates of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson, the estate of Tony Hancock, and the British Film Institute.<\\/p> Hancock's Half Hour Triple Bill: Part XI  Proudly presented as part of our MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue our longstanding celebration of the inimitable Tony Hancock, with a further three episodes of Hancock's classic work. The Tony Hancock Appreciation Society will introduce and discuss the episode afterwards as usual.\\u00a0Episodes:Hancock's Half Hour: The New Nose (Made at Riverside)Hancock (1963 ATV Series): The Eye WitnessHancock: The Bedsitter\\u00a0With thanks to our collaborators on this event, the Tony Hancock Appreciation Society, the estates of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson, the estate of Tony Hancock, and the British Film Institute.\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/gv-bossa-nova-night-a-tribute-to-joao-gilberto-by-mario-bakuna\\/\",\"id\":\"965\",\"name\":\"Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna\",\"title\":\"Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna\",\"duration\":\"90 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1769817600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/30802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:30<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1769887800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1769817600],\"start_date\":\"1769887800\",\"end_date\":\"1769887800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"cUduTEFRRnRaNzFXbGs0Rzg1eGxydz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 31 Jan 2026\",\"text\":\"Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and VocalsFollowing sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w880\\/q80\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.jpg\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1210\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1470\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1680\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5e\\/d3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975\\/w2880\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx1359\\/cy33\\/cw3305\\/ch3300\\/images\\/uploads\\/5ed3c152ad1dcfd8c0c199f6ffb17975.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and VocalsFollowing sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario Bakuna is delighted to bring this special concert to the Riverside Studios.Join him in celebrating the legacy of Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto, the legendary Brazilian musician and pioneering father of Bossa Nova in the late 1950s. In this heartfelt tribute, Mario Bakuna presents reinterpretations of Gilberto\\u2019s work alongside his own original compositions. Audiences can expect a rich blend of traditional samba elements, syncopated rhythms of plucked chords, and the breezy sophistication that defines Bossa Nova.\\u00a0Mario Bakuna is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist with over 20 years of professional experience, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario focuses on both original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists like Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and Jo\\u00e3o Donato. In recent years, he has also dedicated his research and performance to reinterpreting Samba Jazz, a genre that emerged in 1950s Rio de Janeiro through the work of artists like Luiz E\\u00e7a, Tamba Trio, and Edson Machado. This style blends Brazilian standards with sophisticated harmonies influenced by the post\\u2013bossa nova movement.Driven by a passion for musical exploration, Mario moved to Europe to deepen his research and expand his artistic horizons. Since settling in London, he has collaborated with artists such as Jean Toussaint, Liam Noble, Ricardo dos Santos, Edmundo Carneiro, Cacau Queiroz, Alain Jean-Marie, Dudu Penz, and Fil\\u00f3 Machado. He has since become a prominent figure and key reference in the UK\\u2019s Brazilian jazz scene, performing extensively across Europe and beyond at renowned venues and international festivals.His albums Where Rio de Janeiro Meets Bahia and Brazilian Landscapes highlight his ability to fuse traditional roots with a contemporary musical sensibility. With sold-out concerts and critical acclaim, these projects have toured across 20 European countries, as well as Brazil, Canada, Madagascar, Egypt, Kazakhstan, and Azerbaijan\\u2014captivating audiences around the world.\\u00a0\\u201cMario Bakuna, a sparkling guitarist, plays with palpable feeling - his virtuosic fluency on the fretboard is controlled and flourishes are perfectly placed. His voice has a texture like heavy cloth\\u201d. (Songlines Magazine)\\u201cMario Bakuna, a man who exudes music. (\\u2026) \\u2018vocals\\u2019 doesn\\u2019t begin to do him justice: his expressive range and the precision with which he was able to deploy it was truly the band\\u2019s fifth instrument. \\u00a0(\\u2026) And he did this while playing guitar with precision and finesse. (\\u2026) his solos were a further source of amazement, his technique somewhere between finger-picking style and classical. His solo introduction to a Baden Powell number made a hash of any attempt at a definition.\\u201d (The Whitman Review, Wakefield Jazz)\\u00a0Website: https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.comFacebook: https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusicianInstagram: https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakunaYouTube: https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakunaListen:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com\\u00a0Video sample:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE\",\"book_link\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/30802\\/\",\"search\":\"Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna   <p><i>Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and Vocals<\\/i><\\/p><p>Following sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario Bakuna is delighted to bring this special concert to the Riverside Studios.<\\/p><p>Join him in celebrating the legacy of Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto, the legendary Brazilian musician and pioneering father of Bossa Nova in the late 1950s. In this heartfelt tribute, Mario Bakuna presents reinterpretations of Gilberto\\u2019s work alongside his own original compositions. Audiences can expect a rich blend of traditional samba elements, syncopated rhythms of plucked chords, and the breezy sophistication that defines Bossa Nova.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><strong>Mario Bakuna<\\/strong> is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist with over 20 years of professional experience, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario focuses on both original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists like Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and Jo\\u00e3o Donato. In recent years, he has also dedicated his research and performance to reinterpreting Samba Jazz, a genre that emerged in 1950s Rio de Janeiro through the work of artists like Luiz E\\u00e7a, Tamba Trio, and Edson Machado. This style blends Brazilian standards with sophisticated harmonies influenced by the post\\u2013bossa nova movement.<\\/p><p>Driven by a passion for musical exploration, Mario moved to Europe to deepen his research and expand his artistic horizons. Since settling in London, he has collaborated with artists such as Jean Toussaint, Liam Noble, Ricardo dos Santos, Edmundo Carneiro, Cacau Queiroz, Alain Jean-Marie, Dudu Penz, and Fil\\u00f3 Machado. He has since become a prominent figure and key reference in the UK\\u2019s Brazilian jazz scene, performing extensively across Europe and beyond at renowned venues and international festivals.<\\/p><p>His albums <i>Where Rio de Janeiro Meets Bahia<\\/i> and <i>Brazilian Landscapes<\\/i> highlight his ability to fuse traditional roots with a contemporary musical sensibility. With sold-out concerts and critical acclaim, these projects have toured across 20 European countries, as well as Brazil, Canada, Madagascar, Egypt, Kazakhstan, and Azerbaijan\\u2014captivating audiences around the world.<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>\\u201c<i>Mario Bakuna, a sparkling guitarist, plays with palpable feeling - his virtuosic fluency on the fretboard is controlled and flourishes are perfectly placed. His voice has a texture like heavy cloth\\u201d. (Songlines Magazine)<\\/i><\\/p><p><i>\\u201cMario Bakuna, a man who exudes music. (\\u2026) \\u2018vocals\\u2019 doesn\\u2019t begin to do him justice: his expressive range and the precision with which he was able to deploy it was truly the band\\u2019s fifth instrument. &nbsp;(\\u2026) And he did this while playing guitar with precision and finesse. (\\u2026) his solos were a further source of amazement, his technique somewhere between finger-picking style and classical. His solo introduction to a Baden Powell number made a hash of any attempt at a definition.\\u201d (The Whitman Review, Wakefield Jazz)<\\/i><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Website: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.com<\\/a><\\/p><p>Facebook: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusician\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusician<\\/a><\\/p><p>Instagram: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakuna\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakuna<\\/a><\\/p><p>YouTube: <a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakuna\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakuna<\\/a><\\/p><p>Listen:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com<\\/a><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>Video sample:&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE<\\/a><\\/p> Bossa Nova Night: A Tribute to Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto by Mario Bakuna  Featuring Mario Bakuna on Acoustic Guitar and VocalsFollowing sold-out performances across the UK, Portugal, France, Spain, and the Netherlands, Mario Bakuna is delighted to bring this special concert to the Riverside Studios.Join him in celebrating the legacy of Jo\\u00e3o Gilberto, the legendary Brazilian musician and pioneering father of Bossa Nova in the late 1950s. In this heartfelt tribute, Mario Bakuna presents reinterpretations of Gilberto\\u2019s work alongside his own original compositions. Audiences can expect a rich blend of traditional samba elements, syncopated rhythms of plucked chords, and the breezy sophistication that defines Bossa Nova.\\u00a0Mario Bakuna is a Brazilian composer, arranger, vocalist, and guitarist with over 20 years of professional experience, currently based in London, UK. Well known for his deep exploration of traditional Brazilian rhythms, samba, jazz, and bossa nova, Mario focuses on both original compositions and fresh arrangements of works by iconic artists like Tom Jobim, Dorival Caymmi, Paulo Moura, and Jo\\u00e3o Donato. In recent years, he has also dedicated his research and performance to reinterpreting Samba Jazz, a genre that emerged in 1950s Rio de Janeiro through the work of artists like Luiz E\\u00e7a, Tamba Trio, and Edson Machado. This style blends Brazilian standards with sophisticated harmonies influenced by the post\\u2013bossa nova movement.Driven by a passion for musical exploration, Mario moved to Europe to deepen his research and expand his artistic horizons. Since settling in London, he has collaborated with artists such as Jean Toussaint, Liam Noble, Ricardo dos Santos, Edmundo Carneiro, Cacau Queiroz, Alain Jean-Marie, Dudu Penz, and Fil\\u00f3 Machado. He has since become a prominent figure and key reference in the UK\\u2019s Brazilian jazz scene, performing extensively across Europe and beyond at renowned venues and international festivals.His albums Where Rio de Janeiro Meets Bahia and Brazilian Landscapes highlight his ability to fuse traditional roots with a contemporary musical sensibility. With sold-out concerts and critical acclaim, these projects have toured across 20 European countries, as well as Brazil, Canada, Madagascar, Egypt, Kazakhstan, and Azerbaijan\\u2014captivating audiences around the world.\\u00a0\\u201cMario Bakuna, a sparkling guitarist, plays with palpable feeling - his virtuosic fluency on the fretboard is controlled and flourishes are perfectly placed. His voice has a texture like heavy cloth\\u201d. (Songlines Magazine)\\u201cMario Bakuna, a man who exudes music. (\\u2026) \\u2018vocals\\u2019 doesn\\u2019t begin to do him justice: his expressive range and the precision with which he was able to deploy it was truly the band\\u2019s fifth instrument. \\u00a0(\\u2026) And he did this while playing guitar with precision and finesse. (\\u2026) his solos were a further source of amazement, his technique somewhere between finger-picking style and classical. His solo introduction to a Baden Powell number made a hash of any attempt at a definition.\\u201d (The Whitman Review, Wakefield Jazz)\\u00a0Website: https:\\/\\/www.mariobakuna.comFacebook: https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/MarioBakunaMusicianInstagram: https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/mariobakunaYouTube: https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/c\\/mariobakunaListen:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/mariobakuna.bandcamp.com\\u00a0Video sample:\\u00a0https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=i8f5jxuzASE\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/by-riverscribes-introduction-to-screenwriting\\/\",\"id\":\"676\",\"name\":\"Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting\",\"title\":\"Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting\",\"duration\":\"\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1770681600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15143\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1770750000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1771891200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15189\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1771959600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1774310400\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/15195\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1774378800\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1770681600,1771891200,1774310400],\"start_date\":\"1770750000\",\"end_date\":\"1774378800\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"OWMyYmFKMnJNNHBpY0VXU1c3NGhVUT09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Tue 10 Feb - Tue 24 Mar 2026\",\"text\":\"Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.png\",\"image_source\":\"type=\\\"image\\/webp\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 880w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1210w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1470w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1680w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1870w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2048w,https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2880w\\\"\",\"image_alt\":\"\",\"image_cap\":\"\",\"image_data\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 880w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1210w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1470w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/90\\/02d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec\\/w500\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/9002d32c8b9f682c43cef7c1455392ec.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!\\u00a0About Henry Fitzherbert:Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.He co-wrote the hit Netflix series WYATT EARP & THE COWBOY WAR (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.Previously, Henry wrote BORN A KING (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.He co-wrote SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ (2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the London Film School and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.Website: henryfitzherbert.com\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting   <p>Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!<\\/p><p>Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.<\\/p><p>It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.<\\/p><p>Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.<\\/p><p>The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.<\\/p><p>Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!<\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i><strong>About Henry Fitzherbert:<\\/strong><\\/i><\\/p><p>Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.<\\/p><p>He co-wrote the hit Netflix series <i>WYATT EARP &amp; THE COWBOY WAR<\\/i> (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.<\\/p><p>Previously, Henry wrote <i>BORN A KING<\\/i> (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.<\\/p><p>He co-wrote<i> SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ <\\/i>(2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.<\\/p><p>A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the <strong>London Film School<\\/strong> and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.<\\/p><p>Website: henryfitzherbert.com<\\/p> Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting  Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!\\u00a0About Henry Fitzherbert:Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.He co-wrote the hit Netflix series WYATT EARP & THE COWBOY WAR (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.Previously, Henry wrote BORN A KING (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.He co-wrote SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ (2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the London Film School and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.Website: henryfitzherbert.com\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/rive