038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w1870\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/5b\\/dfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe\\/w2048\\/q80\\/wpojpg\\/cx625\\/cy62\\/cw1038\\/ch1036\\/images\\/uploads\\/5bdfa3ac4f46039c2b6f631d3a1b54fe.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Written and performed by Lisa RoseNorth London actress and writer\\u00a0Lisa Rose\\u00a0brings her powerful and darkly funny solo show\\u00a0Too Small to\\u00a0Tellto the stage \\u2014 a deeply personal story inspired by her experiences working for a now-notorious film mogul in the 1990s.Blending humour and heartbreak, Rose explores power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets. Following\\u00a0sold-out performances at Park Theatre\\u00a0and\\u00a0packed houses at Upstairs at the Gatehouse, the play was\\u00a0shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.Directed by\\u00a0Elizabeth Ranken\\u00a0and co-created with\\u00a0Paula B. Stanic, *Too Small to\\u00a0Tell\\u00a0is a timely and gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.\\\"Truthful, touching, timely, terrific!\\\"\\\"A story that should never stop being told.\\\"\\u00a0@toosmalltotell |\\u00a0facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Too Small to Tell Too Small to Tell   <p><strong>Written and performed by Lisa Rose<\\/strong><\\/p><p>North London actress and writer&nbsp;<strong>Lisa Rose<\\/strong>&nbsp;brings her powerful and darkly funny solo show&nbsp;<i><strong>Too Small to&nbsp;Tell<\\/strong><\\/i>to the stage \\u2014 a deeply personal story inspired by her experiences working for a now-notorious film mogul in the 1990s.<\\/p><p>Blending humour and heartbreak, Rose explores power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets. Following&nbsp;<strong>sold-out performances at Park Theatre<\\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>packed houses at Upstairs at the Gatehouse<\\/strong>, the play was&nbsp;<strong>shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025<\\/strong>.<\\/p><p>Directed by&nbsp;<strong>Elizabeth Ranken<\\/strong>&nbsp;and co-created with&nbsp;<strong>Paula B. Stanic<\\/strong>, *<i>Too Small to&nbsp;Tell<\\/i>&nbsp;is a timely and gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.<\\/p><blockquote><p><i>\\\"Truthful, touching, timely, terrific!\\\"<\\/i><br><i>\\\"A story that should never stop being told.\\\"<\\/i><\\/p><\\/blockquote><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p>@toosmalltotell |&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell<\\/a><\\/p> Too Small to Tell  Written and performed by Lisa RoseNorth London actress and writer\\u00a0Lisa Rose\\u00a0brings her powerful and darkly funny solo show\\u00a0Too Small to\\u00a0Tellto the stage \\u2014 a deeply personal story inspired by her experiences working for a now-notorious film mogul in the 1990s.Blending humour and heartbreak, Rose explores power, silence, and survival in an industry built on secrets. Following\\u00a0sold-out performances at Park Theatre\\u00a0and\\u00a0packed houses at Upstairs at the Gatehouse, the play was\\u00a0shortlisted for Best New Play at Brighton Fringe 2025.Directed by\\u00a0Elizabeth Ranken\\u00a0and co-created with\\u00a0Paula B. Stanic, *Too Small to\\u00a0Tell\\u00a0is a timely and gripping exploration of resilience, sisterhood, and speaking truth to power.\\\"Truthful, touching, timely, terrific!\\\"\\\"A story that should never stop being told.\\\"\\u00a0@toosmalltotell |\\u00a0facebook.com\\/toosmalltotell\"},{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/whats-on\\/Nj-sweet-sounds-of-the-south\\/\",\"id\":\"703\",\"name\":\"Sweet Sounds Of The South\",\"title\":\"Sweet Sounds Of The South\",\"duration\":\"180 minutes\",\"slot_tag\":\"\",\"link_title\":\"More Info\",\"performances\":{\"1772841600\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/22802\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1772910000\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1775257200\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/21204\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1775325600\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}],\"1778886000\":[{\"tag_ids\":[],\"tag_name\":\"\",\"html\":\"<a class=\\\"performance button\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/seats\\/23416\\/\\\">\\n   \\n      <div class=\\\"performance-time\\\" data-acc=\\\"\\\">19:00<\\/div>\\n    \\n<\\/a>\\n\",\"timestamp\":\"1778954400\",\"accessibility_class\":\"\"}]},\"performance_dates\":[1772841600,1775257200,1778886000],\"start_date\":\"1772910000\",\"end_date\":\"1778954400\",\"age_rating_class\":\"\",\"ticket_free\":false,\"priority_booking\":true,\"hash\":\"WktySTZPQ1I3NUlXNSt4Y29abW80Zz09\",\"embed_id\":\"\",\"embed_host\":\"\",\"date_formatted\":\"Sat 7 Mar - Sat 16 May 2026\",\"text\":\"Evol creations\\u2019 Riverside Folk and Blues Music Nights presents:Sweet Sounds of the South&nbsp;Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing&hellip;\",\"image_url\":\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cc\\/9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b\\/w880\\/q80\\/images\\/uploa