ges\\/custom\\/cc\\/9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/cc9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b.webp 1680w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cc\\/9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/cc9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b.webp 1870w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cc\\/9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/cc9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b.webp 2048w\",\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/custom\\/cc\\/9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b\\/w1080\\/q80\\/wpopng\\/images\\/uploads\\/cc9983171c032d87a3885dbb69e8961b.webp 2880w\"],\"focal_point\":\"\",\"search_text\":\"Evol creations\\u2019 Riverside Folk and Blues Music Nights presents:Sweet Sounds of the South\\u00a0Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.\",\"book_link\":false,\"search\":\"Sweet Sounds Of The South Sweet Sounds Of The South   <p><strong>Evol creations\\u2019 Riverside Folk and Blues Music Nights presents:<\\/strong><\\/p><p><strong>Sweet Sounds of the South<\\/strong><\\/p><p>&nbsp;<\\/p><p><i>Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.<\\/i><\\/p> Sweet Sounds Of The South  Evol creations\\u2019 Riverside Folk and Blues Music Nights presents:Sweet Sounds of the South\\u00a0Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.\"}]",
