          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Rehearsal Room | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Whether you're rehearsing an upcoming production, organising a table read, or want to invite guests to a sharing, our Rehearsal Room offers the ideal setup. Designed with flexibility in mind, this 100m² space is equipped with everything you need to bring\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Rehearsal Room\",\"description\":\"Whether you're rehearsing an upcoming production, organising a table read, or want to invite guests to a sharing, our Rehearsal Room offers the ideal setup. Designed with flexibility in mind, this 100m\\u00b2 space is equipped with everything you need to bring your creative vision to life.&nbsp;Seamless, Stress-Free BookingOur new booking system is as simple as it gets \\u2013 no deposits, no back-and-forth emails, just a quick online payment with your credit card. Choose your slot, confirm your booking, and you\\u2019re all set!Daily Time Slots Available, 7 days a week:- 9 am - 1 pm- 2 pm - 6 pm- 7 pm - 11 pmFrom only \\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot), you get access to a versatile rehearsal room with everything you need for a productive session.&nbsp;Pricing\\u00a315\\/hr (\\u00a360 per slot)We are booking until the end of October 2025 - future dates will be released at a later date.20% discount when booking multiple slots in the same transaction.50% \\u2018day of\\u2019 discount, if space is available.Please note that these rates are for private rehearsal space bookings and not for ticketed or private events. If you would like to enquire about hiring the space beyond a simple rehearsal please do so here: https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/rehearsal-room\\/&nbsp;Room Highlights- Capacity: Comfortably accommodates up to 20 people.- Specifications: 102 m\\u00b2, frosted windows for privacy, but lots of natural light during the day.- Speaker available on request, subject to availability.- Furniture: Includes two trestle tables and eight stackable chairs, giving you the freedom to arrange the space as you need. You can bring additional pieces as required.- Access: An access code will be provided upon arrival.- Setup &amp; Reset: Please ensure the room is left as you found it for the next guests. It is fully cleaned and serviced daily.- Vinyl floor (not carpet).- Suitable for music.- Ample power outlets.- Fully wheelchair accessible.- Pet-friendly.- Bathrooms down a very short corridor nearby.- Our delightful Bakery to keep you caffeinated\\/snacked during the day, and our Bar &amp; Kitchen to keep you fed and watered after your full creative day.&nbsp;Why Choose Riverside Studios?Riverside Studios offers more than just space \\u2013 it\\u2019s a creative hub with an atmosphere designed to inspire and support your work. Our rehearsal room is versatile, easy to book, and affordable to help you focus on what matters most: your craft.For any questions or if you are interested in exclusive hire, long-term booking, or booking our spaces for corporate\\/other events, please get in touch with us at&nbsp;[javascript protected email address]\\/**\\/\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/46b4c3d13ab5aa848a91e7c808035df3.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-10T09:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-31T19:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <li