r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w880/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1210/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1470/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1680/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1870/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w2048/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w2880/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position:  50%  50% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w880/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;4096&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;2160&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w880/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1210/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1470/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1680/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w1870/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w2048/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a3/699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec/w2880/q80/images/uploads/a3699de33d719ef8845015fbeec672ec.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>It Was Just an Accident</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Wed 10 - Tue 16 Dec 2025</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"dUFkQlBWN01peXI5WllVTzdGZFd1Zz09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <blockquote><p>\"Jafar Panahi takes us on a nightmare trip into a land of bribes and brutality\" - Guardian ★★★★</p></blockquote><p>Winner of the Palme d’Or at Cannes, <i><strong>IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT</strong></i> is a fearless tour-de-force from cinematic luminary Jafar Panahi. Both urgently political and deeply humane, this new moral classic confronts truth and uncertainty, revenge and mercy, head-on.</p><p>When auto mechanic Vahid unexpectedly encounters the man who may have been his torturer in prison, he kidnaps him with the intention to exact vengeance. But since the sole clue to Eghbal’s identity is the distinct squeak of his prosthetic leg, Vahid turns to a loose circle of other now-freed victims for confirmation. And the danger only escalates.</p><p>As they deal with their past and diverging worldviews, the group struggles to decide: Is this him, without a doubt? What would retribution mean, in actuality?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Unraveling against the ever-present backdrop of authoritarianism, <i>IT WAS JUST AN ACCIDENT</i> coalesces into a climactic act of resistance by an Iranian auteur who is no stranger to unjust detainment himself. Powered by thrilling momentum and peerless craft, France’s <strong>Best International Feature Film</strong> entry to the 98th Academy Awards® asks us to consider – and reconsider – the line between right and wrong.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">104 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n                        <div id=\"member-login\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-nav-top\">\r\n     