          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Old Fat F**k Up | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"★★★★ Phenomenal. Devastating. Unexpectedly hilarious. - All That Dazzles★★★★ Completely mesmerising, deeply complex, so powerful it’s impossible to look away - Everything Theatre★★★★ Old Fat F**k Up is the golden ticket, a theatr\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Old Fat F**k Up\",\"description\":\"\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Phenomenal. Devastating. Unexpectedly hilarious. - All That Dazzles\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Completely mesmerising, deeply complex, so powerful it\\u2019s impossible to look away - Everything Theatre\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Old Fat F**k Up is the golden ticket, a theatrical gem - North West End\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 Laced with humour. Beautiful, raw and deeply human - A Young(ish) PerspectiveEVERYTHING IS GOING TO BE OKAY* &nbsp;Old Fat F**k Up is a show about seeing your naked body in the mirror and crying, discovering your career\\u2019s uncontrollably disintegrating, and realising that suddenly everything costs a bomb. Oh, and now you\\u2019ve got kids too, so there\\u2019s that. Hilarious, right?Following last year's \\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 hilarious and terrifying hit, F**king Legend (Pleasance, Edinburgh; Riverside Studios, London), Olly (and his fairly punchable face) returns with a show that rips into the absurdity of modern life, peels back the layers of middle-aged denial and the pain of parenthood, then exposes the wreckage men leave behind when they\\u2019re just trying not to break things.*but may not be. In fact, let\\u2019s be honest, it probably won\\u2019t be.&nbsp;See F**king Legend alongside Olly\\u2019s new show Old Fat F**k Up and get 20% off full-price tickets when booked together in the same transaction. (Offer applies to full-price tickets only; performances do not need to be on the same day.)\\u2018Olly Hawes is a magnificent writer\\u2019 WhatsOnStage\\u2018An entirely innovative and distinctive voice in contemporary theatre\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland\\u2018A magnificent storyteller\\u2019 British Theatre Guide&nbsp;Olly makes shows that explore the tension between the desires of individuals and the stability of collectives. He is co-artistic director of take stock exchange - their latest series of podcasts, Machloket, made with the Royal Court, is available now. He\\u2019s worked with some of the country\\u2019s most prestigious and exciting venues, including the National Theatre, The Young Vic and The Barbican.&nbsp;P Burton-Morgan has been Artistic Director of Metta Theatre since 2005 for which they have written\\/directed over 30 productions including Sherlock Holmes and the PoisonWood (Watermill) and the WGGB award-winning In the Willows (UK tour). Their debut novel Muddying is currently out on submission with United Agents and they're also a Ledbury Festival slam-winning poet.&nbsp;Praise for F**king LegendTOP 10 SHOW Ed Fringe 2024 &nbsp;\\u2018Extraordinary. I can\\u2019t recommend it enough\\u2019 Fergus Morgan, The Crush Bar&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Terrifically smart and discomforting\\u2026 exhilarating\\u2019 The Scotsman&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018A Marvel to Behold\\u2019 All That Dazzles&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Perfectly eccentric, complex, emotional,\\u2019 Adventures in Theatreland&nbsp;\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605\\u2605 \\u2018Completely and utterly gripping\\u2019 What\\u2019s Good To Do&nbsp;\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/91f43a08c9f878dfef20e604092dabe1.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-10T19:15:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-17T19:15:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/bm-old-fat-fk-up/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz-focus-inner,[type=button]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=reset]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=submit]::-moz-focus-inner{border-style:none;padding:0}button:-moz-focusring,[type=button]:-moz-focusring,[type=reset]:-moz-focusring,[type=submit]:-moz-focusring{outline:1px dotted ButtonText}fieldset{padding:.35em .75em .625em}legend{box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;display:table;max-width