uploads/d04a3fa9424bf44f14391f737ae8fa90.png 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/d0/4a3fa9424bf44f14391f737ae8fa90/w2048/q80/images/uploads/d04a3fa9424bf44f14391f737ae8fa90.png 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/d0/4a3fa9424bf44f14391f737ae8fa90/w2880/q80/images/uploads/d04a3fa9424bf44f14391f737ae8fa90.png 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Disco-cise</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Thu 11 Dec 2025 18:30</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"dE9hU1B4eng4RU40ZW1nNEtaQUVkUT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <h2>Dancercise with Anna as you know it, but turned up a notch.</h2><p>If you’ve been to one of Anna’s classes before, you know the score; a low pressure, fun, supportive and silly environment where you’re encouraged to lose all inhibitions and simply dance like no one is watching. It’s a space to freely move your body with your friends and enjoy a workout that truly doesn’t feel like exercise!</p><p><br>The playlists are a huge part of <strong>Dancercise </strong>classes, and so here’s the fun part: Reuben, Riverside’s resident DJ, will be mixing the tracks and DJ’ing live during class. With lighting, a live DJ and optional drinks at the end of class, this collaboration promises to be the workout of the year. Bring a friend and enjoy a mid week party at Riverside!</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">60 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n