            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you! Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis. The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten. Expect t\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Yoga for all from Lumi Foundation\",\"description\":\"Whether you're brand new to yoga or a seasoned practitioner, this class is for you!&nbsp; Join us to move, breath and connect with fellow local yogis.&nbsp;&nbsp;The class will help you build strength and flexibility while creating space for your mind to quieten.&nbsp; Expect to leave feeling revitalised, energised and filled with a sense of possibility.Please bring your own mat if you can.&nbsp; A limited number are available to borrow at Riverside Studios.&nbsp; This class can also be done using a chair for support.&nbsp;Your teacher will be from Lumi Foundation with proceeds from the class going towards raising funds for Lumi Foundation.&nbsp; Thank you for helping us bring yoga to all!&nbsp;About Lumi FoundationLumi Foundation is an award-winning charity with a simple belief - yoga is for everyone!Founded in 2017, we offer classes to a wide and varied audience. We work with adults and children with disabilities, elderly groups, refugees, those in recovery from addiction, survivors of domestic abuse, low-income communities and individuals undergoing cancer treatment.Our teachers are highly qualified and able to adapt classes to suit the needs of different groups. Typical classes blend mat and chair\\u2011based practices, focusing on movement, breathwork and meditation.Most importantly, these classes are also a way for people to come together and practice as a community.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/7c01907ab70ca28b80e22222b5089965.png\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-11T18:30:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-18T18:30:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/bZ-yoga-for-all-from-lumi-foundation/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz