            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Live Next To The Apollo | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"See the best acts from the circuit at the legendary Riverside Studios before they get their own Netflix special.ABOUTLive Next To The Apollo is a premier stand-up comedy club which has been packing out it's intimate 100-seater venue at the iconic Riversid\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Live Next To The Apollo\",\"description\":\"See the best acts from the circuit at the legendary Riverside Studios before they get their own Netflix special.ABOUTLive Next To The Apollo is a premier stand-up comedy club which has been packing out it's intimate 100-seater venue at the iconic Riverside Studios since it was founded in 2023 by TV Producer Jonathan Stadlen.&nbsp;Known for its high-quality line-ups, affordable ticket prices, and commitment to supporting comedians via transparent profit share, Live Next To The Apollo has become a staple of the London comedy scene.&nbsp;Each show features a specially selected line-up of the UK\\u2019s best comedians, ready to make you laugh for the price of a pint on a Tuesday and two pints and a packet of crisps on a Friday.&nbsp;Come and see why the show has built a&nbsp;reputation as being a friendly and joyful comedy night with a strong local community audience in West London.&nbsp;&nbsp;Fridays - \\u00a314 including booking and credit card&nbsp;fees&nbsp;Tuesdays - \\u00a38.50 including booking and credit card feesPREVIOUS ACTSSara Pascoe (Taskmaster, Last One Laughing), Stephen K Amos (Live at the Apollo, Have I Got News For You), Marcus Brigstocke (Mock The Week, Have I Got News For You), Jen Brister (Live AT The Apollo, Mock The Week), Ian Stone (Mock The Week, Never Mind the Buzzcocks), Laura Smyth (8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown, Live at the Apollo), Desiree Burch (Taskmaster, Live at the Apollo), Nabil Abulrashid (Have I Got News For You, 8 Out of 10 Cats Does Countdown)&nbsp;and Jeff Innocent (British Comedian Of The Year).&nbsp;REVIEWSAwesome comedy club! Great bill of curated comedians and a packed out,&nbsp;up for it audience!&nbsp; \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 James W, June 2025A comedy show that feels like comedy home &amp; line-ups packed with top-class comedians delivering laugh after laugh after laugh!!&nbsp; The atmosphere is always friendly, welcoming and simultaneously electric.&nbsp;Get yourself a ticket, it\\u2019s cheaper than a pint... Your future self will thank you!!&nbsp; \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50&nbsp;Emma, June 2025Was not at all happy, my wife said afterwards that Jonathan the MC is handsome and funny, two things she's never said about me. The comedy is always EXCELLENT though, so I'll go by myself in future.&nbsp; \\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50\\u2b50 S May, 2025\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/c25b75b123c8105ce48ca75e4ea9a33b.png\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-12T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-06-26T19:00:00+01:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/cB-live-next-to-the-apollo/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0