            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Pillion | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"\"Alexander Skarsgård and Harry Melling play unlikely lovers in this sweet and extremely revealing first-time drama from Harry Lighton\" - Guardian ⭐️⭐️ ⭐️ ⭐️Colin (Harry Melling) leads a humdrum existence until he meets the impossibly hand\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Pillion\",\"description\":\"\\\"Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd and Harry Melling play unlikely lovers in this sweet and extremely revealing first-time drama from Harry Lighton\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0f \\u2b50\\ufe0fColin (Harry Melling) leads a humdrum existence until he meets the impossibly handsome Ray (Alexander Skarsg\\u00e5rd), a mysterious biker he is soon desperately devoted to. As Colin submits to Ray and enters an exciting new world of desire, he must decide the limits of his devotion.&nbsp;Hilarious, subversive and sexy, PILLION is the acclaimed and surprisingly tender love story from writer-director Harry Lighton.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/947bf5ffc36087c664368b1dff6c21a3.PNG\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-12T20:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-18T20:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/be-pillion/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\