            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"SpyHards Podcast presents: Spies on Screen is a exciting new programming strand at Riverside Studios! SpyHards is the world’s leading podcast focused exclusively on spy movies and television. Hosted by Scott Hardy and Cam Smith, the show provides weekly\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Thunderball 60th Anniversary Screening + Live Q&A with Martine Beswick\",\"description\":\"SpyHards Podcast presents: Spies on Screen is a exciting new programming strand at Riverside Studios! SpyHards is the world\\u2019s leading podcast focused exclusively on spy movies and television. Hosted by Scott Hardy and Cam Smith, the show provides weekly deep dives into espionage cinema\\u2014from beloved blockbusters to forgotten cult favourites\\u2014alongside interviews with the actors, filmmakers, and creators behind the genre\\u2019s most iconic works.We are delighted for this inaugural event to be welcoming actor Martine Beswick to discuss her role in the iconic 007 franchise, following an anniversary screening of the Sean Connery-starring Bond adventure THUNDERBALL, in which she played Paula. Martine will also be signing autographs later in the cinema foyer (separate fees may apply).&nbsp;THUNDERBALL (1965)Led by one-eyed evil mastermind Emilio Largo (Adolfo Celi), the terrorist group SPECTRE hijacks two warheads from a NATO plane and threatens widespread nuclear destruction to extort millions of pounds. The dashing Agent 007, James Bond (Sean Connery), is sent to recover the warheads from the heart of Largo's lair in the Bahamas, facing underwater attacks from sharks and men alike. He must also convince the enchanting Domino (Claudine Auger), Largo's mistress, to become a key ally.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/d867fcbf391c33d44e199d7ebd4673f4.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-13T14:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-13T14:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/9y-thunderball-60th-anniversary-screening-live-qa-with-martine-beswick/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appe