            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover the therapeutic power of abstract art at Riverside StudiosJoin artist Roya Nozadi for a gentle, grounding workshop designed to be more than a painting class, it’s a practice for your mind, helping you find relief, focus, and creative challenge.\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Explore Creativity & Calm: An Abstract Art Workshop with Mindfulness Practices\",\"description\":\"Discover the therapeutic power of abstract art at Riverside StudiosJoin artist Roya Nozadi for a gentle, grounding workshop designed to be more than a painting class, it\\u2019s a practice for your mind, helping you find relief, focus, and creative challenge.No experience required, just curiosity. Ages 16+.What to expect:Explore how to quiet your mind and being presentExplore intuitive mark-making. Let go of perfection and enjoy creating without rules or pressure.Explore colour, form and line. Build the foundations for future sessions where we\\u2019ll explore texture, collage, and deeper techniques.Explore connection with like-minded people in a warm, supportive creative space&nbsp;All materials are included. You will leave with a clear mind and a finished artwork to take home. Meet the Artist: https:\\/\\/royanozadi.com\\/ Roya Nozadi will guide you through this mindful, creative journey.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/cd2721413feb8669b9d3f606a253bd70.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-13T14:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-13T14:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/1m-explore-creativity-calm-an-abstract-art-workshop-with-mindfulness-practices/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz-focus-inner,[type=button]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=reset]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=submit]::-moz-focus-inner{border-style:none;padding:0}button:-moz-focusring,[type=button]:-moz-focusring,[type=reset]:-moz-focusring,[type=submit]:-moz-focusring{outline:1px dotted ButtonText}fieldset{padding:.35em .75em .625em}legend{box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;display:t