            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Pilates with Athena | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Pilates is a method of exercise that can help to improve flexibility, build strength, endurance, postural alignment, it helps to develop a strong core and improve posture, coordination and balance. Emphasis is on correct breathing, working muscles of the \">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Pilates with Athena\",\"description\":\"Pilates is a method of exercise that can help to improve flexibility, build strength, endurance, postural alignment, it helps to develop a strong core and improve posture, coordination and balance. Emphasis is on correct breathing, working muscles of the abdomen, lower back and hips which are essential for stability and strength of the spine.&nbsp;The Pilates with Athena system allows for exercises to be adapted to suit all levels, whether a complete beginner to more advanced.&nbsp;Pilates is also an excellent method of exercise during all stages of pregnancy, and very good post partum to regain the strength of the core.&nbsp;&nbsp;Pilates is a fantastic mind and body discipline, creating a full body workout using bodyweight and some equipment to enhance some exercises.&nbsp;Instagram: @pilateswithathenaWebsite: Home | My Site\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/30ec28752ef2b3236c2fa62e1dfbe90c.jpg\"],\"star