470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a0/0e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab/w1680/q80/images/uploads/a00e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a0/0e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab/w1870/q80/images/uploads/a00e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a0/0e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab/w2048/q80/images/uploads/a00e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/a0/0e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab/w2880/q80/images/uploads/a00e68f94800448385723cac312ef0ab.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Love Actually (4K Restoration)</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Tue 16 Dec 2025 20:00</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"VVFmcnZQTUZWeVNhdlkzczYzQk03UT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>Get 20% off the adult price for any purchase of more than one ticket for our Christmas line-up:</p><p><i>HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS: 25TH ANNIVERSARY</i></p><p><i>LOVE ACTUALLY: 4K RESTORATION</i></p><p><i>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>LOVE ACTUALLY: 4K RESTORATION</strong></i></p><p>Nine intertwined stories examine the complexities of the one emotion that connects us all: love. Among the characters explored are David (Hugh Grant), the handsome newly elected British prime minister who falls for a young junior staffer (Martine McCutcheon), Sarah (Laura Linney), a graphic designer whose devotion to her mentally ill brother complicates her love life, and Harry (Alan Rickman), a married man tempted by his attractive new secretary.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Ticketholders to our Christmas classics lineup this December can claim a free mince pie from the cinema foyer bar before the show! Applies to:</strong></i></p><p><i><strong>LOVE ACTUALLY</strong></i></p><p><i><strong>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE</strong></i></p><p><i><strong>HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS</strong></i></p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">135 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n   