            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Blue Moon | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"\"Ethan Hawke is terrific in Richard Linklater’s bitter Broadway breakup drama\" - Guardian ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️Richard Linklater (Boyhood, The Before Trilogy) re-teams once more with Ethan Hawke for this acclaimed look at the twilight years of one of\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Blue Moon\",\"description\":\"\\\"Ethan Hawke is terrific in Richard Linklater\\u2019s bitter Broadway breakup drama\\\" - Guardian \\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0f\\u2b50\\ufe0fRichard Linklater (Boyhood, The Before Trilogy) re-teams once more with Ethan Hawke for this acclaimed look at the twilight years of one of the world's great song maestros.On the evening of March 31, 1943, legendary lyricist Lorenz Hart confronts his shattered self-confidence in Sardi\\u2019s bar as his former collaborator Richard Rodgers celebrates the opening night of his ground-breaking hit musical \\u201cOklahoma!\\u201d.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/5283c46403916d400bbc8612bcac2b5d.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2025-12-18T18:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/1P-blue-moon/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"widt