          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Line Dancing | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance? Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do. For safety and style, we recommend wearing boots or dance heels to class – sneakers and slippers aren’t ideal for toe-heel steps\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Line Dancing\",\"description\":\"Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance?&nbsp;Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do.&nbsp;For safety and style, we recommend wearing boots or dance heels to class \\u2013 sneakers and slippers aren\\u2019t ideal for toe-heel steps. Feel free to bring your cowboy, party, or sun hats too \\u2013 they\\u2019re great for adding flair to the choreography.Lisa is an ex professional dancer. She trained at Bush Davies Ballet School. She joined Second Generation dance company for Dougie Squires and toured the UK, France and Germany; performing in theatres and television. Lisa danced in the opening sequence of Indiana Jones and The Temple of Doom, for Danny Daniels.&nbsp;She has worked for many choreographers including: Carole Todd, Jack Gunn, Irving Davies, Tommy Tucker, Luke Batchelor, Jane Darling and Libby Roberts. Her other dance and acting credits include:&nbsp;\\u201cThe Benny Hill show\\u201d for Thames TV; Hills Angel.&nbsp;\\u201cA Night On The Town\\u201dwith Elaine Paige, Lewis Collins, Anne Reinking and Eartha Kitt.&nbsp;\\u201cNoises Off\\u201d&nbsp; at The Savoy Theatre for two years, playing Brooke Ashton.&nbsp;\\u201cWhose Baby\\u201d&nbsp; Hostess for Thames TV.&nbsp;\\u201cKing and Castle\\u201d with Nigel Planner for Thames TV.&nbsp;\\u201cA Bit on the Side\\u201d playing a wife, with Lionel Blair and Jeremy Bulloch.&nbsp;\\u201cAladdin\\u201d pantomime playing Princess Jasmin at Middleton Civic Theatre.&nbsp;\\u201cMother Goose\\u201d playing Jill, with Danny La Rue,&nbsp; Churchill Theatre, Bromely.&nbsp;\\u201cChristine Keeler\\u201d playing Christine in a silent film for channel 4.&nbsp;\\u201cDame Vera Lynn 100\\u201d at The Palladium, 2017, dancing in LalaLand.&nbsp;&nbsp;Lisa lived in the Far East for nine years; where she taught Aerobics, Hour Of Power and choreographed \\u201cStepping Out\\u201d for ACT in Hong Kong. She played the Dark Witch in \\u201cThe Dark Of The Moon\\u201d in Tokyo for TIP.&nbsp; Lisa also had her own dance group called&nbsp; \\u201cShades of Dance\\u201d, doing private shows at venues like The Hurlingham club. She danced forBEIJA FLOR, the Brazilian dance company in shows, conferences and carnivals. She recently choreographed and danced in \\u201cThe Working Girls of Soho,\\u201d at The Phoenix Arts club and The Kings Head Theatre in Islington.&nbsp;Currently, Lisa teaches Wedding couples first dances and&nbsp; corporate and Hen party dance classes.&nbsp;So: Dust off your Stetsons, polish your Cowboy boots, jump into your jeans and checked shirts and come down to Riverside Studios to join in the fun of Line dancing!&nbsp;We start on Tuesday, January 14th at 6pm , with a second class on Tuesday January 28th, at 6pm. A perfect way to start your New Year!\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2025-12-19T18:30:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-20T18:30:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/16-line-dancing/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz-focus-inner,[type=button]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=reset]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=submit]::-moz-focus-inner{border-style:none;padding:0}button:-moz-focusring,[type=button]:-moz-focusring,[type=reset]:-moz-focusring,[type=submit]:-moz-focusring{outline:1px dotted ButtonText}fieldset{padding:.35em .75em .625em}legend{box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;display:table;max-width:100%;padding:0;white-space:normal}progress{vertical-align:baseline}textarea{overflow:auto}[type=checkbox],[type=radio]{box-sizing:border-box;padding:0}[type=number]::-webkit-inner-spin-button,[type=number]::-webkit-outer-spin-button{height:auto}[type=search]{-webkit-appearance:textfield;outline-of