       \n                                <div class=\"sub-nav-text font-bold font-xsmall font-blue\">Explore Riverside's unique history as a multi-arts venue and meet our current team.</div>\n                \n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-bottom container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n                            \n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/about-us/our-story/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Our Story\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Our Story                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/about-us/our-archive/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Our Archive\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Our Archive                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/about-us/the-team/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"The Team\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      The Team                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"nav-item has-sub-nav\">\n    <a  href=\"javascript:void(0);\"  aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title\" title=\"Memberships\">\n        Memberships    </a>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav\">\n          <div class=\"container desktop-only-break-1024 sub-nav-inner\">\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-top container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n\n              <div class=\"sub-nav-top-content\">\n                <button class=\"button button-text button-text-back button-back\">Back</button>\n\n                                <div class=\"font-sub-nav-title sub-nav-title  font-title  font-uppercase font-blue\"><span>Join & Support Us</span>\r\n</div>\n                \n\n                \n                                <div class=\"sub-nav-text font-bold font-xsmall font-blue\">Get more from Riverside Studios with our range of membership options, offering priority booking, discounted tickets and invitations to special events.  \r\n</div>\n                \n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-bottom container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n                            \n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/memberships/riverside-pass/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Riverside Pass\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Riverside Pass                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/memberships/dive-in-membership/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Dive In Membership\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Dive In Membership                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/memberships/founder-members/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Founder Members\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Founder Members                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/memberships/make-a-donation/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Make a Donation\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Make a Donation                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n<div class=\"nav-item has-sub-nav\">\n    <a  href=\"javascript:void(0);\"  aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title\" title=\"Hire Us / Work With Us\">\n        Hire Us / Work With Us    </a>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav\">\n          <div class=\"container desktop-only-break-1024 sub-nav-inner\">\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-top container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n\n              <div class=\"sub-nav-top-content\">\n                <button class=\"button button-text button-text-back button-back\">Back</button>\n\n                                <div class=\"font-sub-nav-title sub-nav-title  font-title  font-uppercase font-blue\"><span>Hire Us / Work With Us</span>\r\n</div>\n                \n\n                \n                                <div class=\"sub-nav-text font-bold font-xsmall font-blue\">Comprehensive venue information and contact details for those wanting to bring their production to Riverside Studios, to host a private event or to work here. </div>\n                \n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"sub-nav-bottom container mobile-only-break-1024\">\n                            \n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/private-events-and-office-hire/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Private Events and Office Hire\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Private Events and Office Hire                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/bring-a-show-or-workshop/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Bring a Show or Workshop\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Bring a Show or Workshop                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/community-partnership-enquiries/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Community & Partnership Enquiries\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Community & Partnership Enquiries                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n            <div class=\"nav-item \">\r\n              <a class=\"nav-title has-icon search\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/search/\"><span>Search</span></a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </nav>\r\n          <nav class=\"shop-nav container mobile-only-break-1024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"member-nav\" data-url=\"https://spektrix.riversidestudios.co.uk/riversidestudios/api/v3/customer?$expand=subscriptions\" class=\"nav-item\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-item\">\r\n            \t<a draggable=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title has-icon basket basket-trigger\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/basket/\"><span>Basket</span> </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"nav-item acc\">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"acs-button\" aria-label = \"Open Accessibility menu\">\r\n                <span>Accessibility</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </nav>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\n  <div class=\"video-modals\"></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo riverside-logo\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo studios-logo\"><span></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"membership-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay-login\"></div>\n    <main class=\"outer-container\"  id=\"main-content\"  >\n      <div class=\"filter-overlay\"></div>\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page page-event\">\r\n  <section class=\"template template-event-detail play-container has-modal  has-text-bottom      \">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w880/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1210/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1470/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1680/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1870/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w2048/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w2681/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 49.3% 18.1% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w880/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;49.3&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;18.1&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;2681&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;3905&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;portrait&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w880/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1210/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1470/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1680/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w1870/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w2048/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6b/a8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de/w2681/q80/images/uploads/6ba8e26b49d500343d55f91b68f792de.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Line Dancing</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Fri 19 Dec 2025 - Fri 20 Mar 2026</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"dER2YUFWVXhhSUgyZnpXbnBrRWkwUT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><strong>Have you ever wanted to learn to Line dance?&nbsp;</strong></p><p>Lisa Willner will be teaching short Line dance routines that everyone can do.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>For safety and style, we recommend wearing boots or dance heels to class – sneakers and slippers aren’t ideal for toe-heel steps. Feel free to bring your cowboy, party, or sun hats too – they’re great for adding flair to the choreography.</strong></p><p>Lisa is an ex professional dancer. She trained at Bush Davies Ballet School. She joined Second Generation dance company for Dougie Squires and toured the UK, France and Germany; performing in theatres and television. Lisa danced in the opening sequence of Indiana Jones and The Temple of Doom, for Danny Daniels.&nbsp;</p><p>She has worked for many choreographers including: Carole Todd, Jack Gunn, Irving Davies, Tommy Tucker, Luke Batchelor, Jane Darling and Libby Roberts. Her other dance and acting credits include:&nbsp;</p><p>“The Benny Hill show” for Thames TV; Hills Angel.&nbsp;</p><p>“A Night On The Town”with Elaine Paige, Lewis Collins, Anne Reinking and Eartha Kitt.&nbsp;</p><p>“Noises Off”&nbsp; at The Savoy Theatre for two years, playing Brooke Ashton.&nbsp;</p><p>“Whose Baby”&nbsp; Hostess for Thames TV.&nbsp;</p><p>“King and Castle” with Nigel Planner for Thames TV.&nbsp;</p><p>“A Bit on the Side” playing a wife, with Lionel Blair and Jeremy Bulloch.&nbsp;</p><p>“Aladdin” pantomime playing Princess Jasmin at Middleton Civic Theatre.&nbsp;</p><p>“Mother Goose” playing Jill, with Danny La Rue,&nbsp; Churchill Theatre, Bromely.&nbsp;</p><p>“Christine Keeler” playing Christine in a silent film for channel 4.&nbsp;</p><p>“Dame Vera Lynn 100” at The Palladium, 2017, dancing in LalaLand.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Lisa lived in the Far East for nine years; where she taught Aerobics, Hour Of Power and choreographed “Stepping Out” for ACT in Hong Kong. She played the Dark Witch in “The Dark Of The Moon” in Tokyo for TIP.&nbsp; Lisa also had her own dance group called&nbsp; “Shades of Dance”, doing private shows at venues like The Hurlingham club. She danced forBEIJA FLOR, the Brazilian dance company in shows, conferences and carnivals. She recently choreographed and danced in “The Working Girls of Soho,” at The Phoenix Arts club and The Kings Head Theatre in Islington.&nbsp;</p><p>Currently, Lisa teaches Wedding couples first dances and&nbsp; corporate and Hen party dance classes.&nbsp;</p><p>So: Dust off your Stetsons, polish your Cowboy boots, jump into your jeans and checked shirts and come down to Riverside Studios to join in the fun of Line dancing!&nbsp;</p><p>We start on Tuesday, January 14th at 6pm , with a second class on Tuesday January 28th, at 6pm. A perfect way to start your New Year!</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">60 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n                        <div id=\"member-login\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-nav-top\">\r\n                                <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">Our Website</h5>\r\n                                <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/privacy-and-cookies/\">Privacy and Cookies</a>\r\n                              <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/website-accessibility/\">Website Accessibility</a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer-logos\">\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-social\">\r\n            <div class=\"footer-social-inner\">\r\n              <nav class=\"social-icons \">\r\n                <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/RiversideStudiosLondon/\" class=\"facebook\" title=\"Facebook\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Facebook</span></a>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/riversidestudioslondon/?hl=en\" class=\"instagram\" title=\"Instagram\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Instagram</span></a>\r\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/RiversideLondon\" class=\"x-twitter\" title=\"X\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"sr-only\">X</span></a>\r\n              </nav>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-legal\">\r\n        <span class=\"footer-copy font-tiny font-white\">&copy; Anil Agarwal Riverside Studios Trust. All rights reserved.</span>\r\n        <a href=\"https://grandad.digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"footer-credit font-tiny font-white\">Site by Grandad.digital</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</footer>\n<div id=\"event-sidebar-bg\" class=\"event-sidebar-bg\"></div>\n<div id=\"event-sidebar\" class=\"event-sidebar\"></div>\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"modal\"></div>\n\n\n\n<script>window.MSInputMethodContext && document.documentMode && document.write('');</script>\n\n\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/jquery.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/jqueryui.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/js.cookie.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/plyr.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/headroom.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/body-scroll-lock.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/isotope.pkgd.min.js?v=94e327