&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w880/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w1210/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w1470/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w1673/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w1673/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w1673/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/30/75024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6/w1673/q80/images/uploads/3075024ca070947787471d6c52b492c6.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>It's a Wonderful Life (4K Restoration)</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Sat 20 - Wed 24 Dec 2025</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"UjNKS0NOd3NKOVJOYndSS3RsT3J3QT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>Get 20% off the adult price for any purchase of more than one ticket for our Christmas line-up:</p><p><i>HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS: 25TH ANNIVERSARY</i></p><p><i>LOVE ACTUALLY: 4K RESTORATION</i></p><p><i>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE: 4K RESTORATION</strong></i></p><blockquote><p>\"A crisis in housing, a racist ruling class and a struggle against a hideous ego-plutocrat who names everything after himself – this 1946 classic still resonates\" - ★ ★ ★ ★ ★ Guardian</p></blockquote><p>SCREENING FROM A 4K RESTORATION...THE CHRISTMAS CLASSIC!</p><p>Beset with personal and professional problems, George Bailey (James Stewart) finds his previously happy life falling apart around him on Christmas Eve. Seeing no way out, George considers suicide from the edge of a bridge - but Clarence, his guardian angel, intervenes and shows George what his beloved hometown of Bedford Falls would be like without him. Shocked by what he sees and at the unforeseen circumstances of his absence, George reconsiders and begs Clarence to return him to the problems of the present and the loving community he has fostered throughout his life.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Ticketholders to our Christmas classics lineup this December can claim a free mince pie from the cinema foyer bar before the show! Applies to:</strong></i></p><p><i><strong>LOVE ACTUALLY</strong></i></p><p><i><strong>IT'S A WONDERFUL LIFE</strong></i></p><p><i><strong>HOW THE GRINCH STOLE CHRISTMAS</strong></i></p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">130 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-i