            </div>\r\n          </nav>\r\n          <nav class=\"shop-nav container mobile-only-break-1024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"member-nav\" data-url=\"https://spektrix.riversidestudios.co.uk/riversidestudios/api/v3/customer?$expand=subscriptions\" class=\"nav-item\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-item\">\r\n            \t<a draggable=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title has-icon basket basket-trigger\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/basket/\"><span>Basket</span> </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"nav-item acc\">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"acs-button\" aria-label = \"Open Accessibility menu\">\r\n                <span>Accessibility</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </nav>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\n  <div class=\"video-modals\"></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo riverside-logo\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo studios-logo\"><span></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"membership-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay-login\"></div>\n    <main class=\"outer-container\"  id=\"main-content\"  >\n      <div class=\"filter-overlay\"></div>\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page page-event\">\r\n  <section class=\"template template-event-detail play-container has-modal  has-text-bottom      \">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 49.3% 43.0% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w880/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;49.3&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;43.0&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;640&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;427&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/57/ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e/w640/q80/images/uploads/57ed1f11ead4b92c1b4a7a58164a198e.jpeg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Monkeyface</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Thu 8 - Sat 10 Jan 2026</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"L0tjR0VrcXd3bjlCTDg5end4NXQvQT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>Trapped within the four walls of a university bedroom, our title character navigates the euphoric highs and crushing lows of Freshers week, toxic friendships, club culture, and the aching need for connection.&nbsp;</p><p><i><strong>Monkeyface </strong></i>is the bold, debut play by writer-performer Raphael Phillips, that journeys through the themes of racism, mental health, and loneliness.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Content warnings&nbsp;</strong></p><p>This show contains strong language and references to drug use, as well as themes of mental health, racism, and sexual content throughout.&nbsp;</p><p>People under the age of 16 are not permitted for this show.&nbsp;</p><p>Latecomers will not be admitted for this show.&nbsp;</p><p><br><strong>Director</strong> - Mojola Akinyemi<br><br><strong>Stage Manager &amp; Lighting Designer</strong>: Jessica Speller<br><br><strong>Sound Designer: </strong>Joe Harrington<br><br><strong>Producer: </strong>Emmanuel Akwafo</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">70 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\