            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weeken\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Kill Bill: The Whole Bloody Affair\",\"description\":\"For our Quentin Tarantino Weekender on 10-11 January you can enjoy 20% off the adult price if you buy a ticket for ONE UPON A TIME IN HOLLYWOOD + Q&amp;A on 10 Jan and a ticket to one of the KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR screenings on the same weekend!Get ready to return to the grindhouse \\u2014 Lionsgate is bringing Quentin Tarantino\\u2019s legendary revenge saga back to the big screen with KILL BILL: THE WHOLE BLOODY AFFAIR.For the first time, experience Volumes 1 &amp; 2 seamlessly united in one epic cinematic event \\u2014 featuring a never-before-seen scene that makes this the ultimate Tarantino cut.&nbsp;Includes a 15 minute intermission.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/b396fb3869d6cca05c3b5ad90eafe25f.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-10T12:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-11T13:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>