            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Beaded Jewellery Workshop | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box? Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories? This could be the workshop for you. This beaded jewellery w\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Beaded Jewellery Workshop\",\"description\":\"Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?&nbsp;Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?&nbsp;This could be the workshop for you.&nbsp;This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.&nbsp;Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!&nbsp;About Clair GreenClair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage\\/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.&nbsp;Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of Portobello Market, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-11T14:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-18T14:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/LY-beaded-jewellery-workshop/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz-focus-inner,[type=button]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=rese