          Bring a Show or Workshop                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/community-partnership-enquiries/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Community & Partnership Enquiries\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Community & Partnership Enquiries                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n            <div class=\"nav-item \">\r\n              <a class=\"nav-title has-icon search\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/search/\"><span>Search</span></a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </nav>\r\n          <nav class=\"shop-nav container mobile-only-break-1024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"member-nav\" data-url=\"https://spektrix.riversidestudios.co.uk/riversidestudios/api/v3/customer?$expand=subscriptions\" class=\"nav-item\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-item\">\r\n            \t<a draggable=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title has-icon basket basket-trigger\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/basket/\"><span>Basket</span> </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"nav-item acc\">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"acs-button\" aria-label = \"Open Accessibility menu\">\r\n                <span>Accessibility</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </nav>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\n  <div class=\"video-modals\"></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo riverside-logo\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo studios-logo\"><span></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"membership-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay-login\"></div>\n    <main class=\"outer-container\"  id=\"main-content\"  >\n      <div class=\"filter-overlay\"></div>\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page page-event\">\r\n  <section class=\"template template-event-detail play-container has-modal  has-text-bottom      \">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w880/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1210/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1470/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1680/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1870/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w2048/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w2880/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 44.5% 35.5% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w880/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;44.5&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;35.5&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;4032&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;3024&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w880/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1210/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1470/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1680/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w1870/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w2048/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6c/493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b/w2880/q80/images/uploads/6c493336e0d80a525668cc2727775a3b.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Beaded Jewellery Workshop</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Sun 11 - Sun 18 Jan 2026</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"NFhiZC8wdTZuTzN1elpwdktsTzEvUT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><i>Do you have loose beads from treasured jewellery items rolling around in a box?&nbsp;</i></p><p><i>Have you ever wanted to re-create a sentimental piece and claim back a special item which holds cherished memories?&nbsp;</i></p><p><i>This could be the workshop for you.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This beaded jewellery workshop encourages participants to bring their broken beaded items along and learn the skills to create a final piece, either the same as before or a new re-imagined design.&nbsp;</p><p>Our workshop leader, Clair, provides all the necessary tools and materials to fix and re-build items along with a selection of beads and other components for participants to add into their items or create something completely new. Participants will not only leave with an item they can wear but with new skills to use in the future!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>About Clair Green</strong></p><p>Clair, a third-generation vintage dealer, has been brought up surrounded by vintage beads and various vintage/antique curios. She learned to string beads almost by osmosis while she watched her mother create timeless pieces on the kitchen table, ready to sell at Portobello Market each Saturday.&nbsp;</p><p>Having run her own business for over 20 years, nestled in the heart of <strong>Portobello Market</strong>, Clair has worked with a variety of projects including styling and creating period accessories for film and TV, fashion shoots and stocking vintage boutiques worldwide.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">120 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n      