86036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1210/q80/wpopng/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1470/q80/wpopng/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/wpopng/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/wpopng/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/wpopng/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/wpopng/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 47.2% 43.3% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w880/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;47.2&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;43.3&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;1587&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;1037&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w880/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1210/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1470/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/cb/bb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b/w1587/q80/images/uploads/cbbb8396f386036d6946a93693b08a0b.png 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>The Seat of Me</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Tue 13 - Wed 14 Jan 2026</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"RFVtUWhNMWpLS1RHTjFXcVhmQWJmdz09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><i>The Seat of Me </i>is an intimate, poetic solo show about memory, identity, and the moments that shape us.</p><p>Through stories of Rome, New York, and Los Angeles, Giulia retraces the memories, mentors, and loves she has carried—unpacking each one through the simple, grounding presence of a single chair.</p><p>Guided by the ghost of Edith Piaf, the scars of ballet, an unexpected love story, and the silence left by those who disappeared, she confronts the question that has followed her all her life: <i>Am I enough?</i></p><p>Blending storytelling, physicality, humour, and live fragments of Piaf’s music, <i>The Seat of Me </i>reveals what it means to sit with our past, let it rest, and finally rise as the person we choose to become.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">60 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n        <section class=\"block block-combi-grid\">\n\n\n  <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"block-header has-button\">