            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>For Us, By Us: Workshop Series | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led. “Burnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren’t told often enough.” – LondonTheatre1 on STORIES For Us, By Us is a bold new programme of 12 youth\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"For Us, By Us: Workshop Series\",\"description\":\"Created by young people, for young people. 100% youth-led.&nbsp;\\u201cBurnt Orange Theatre is quite right in their assertion that these sorts of stories aren\\u2019t told often enough.\\u201d \\u2013 LondonTheatre1 on STORIES&nbsp;For Us, By Us is a bold new programme of 12 youth-led workshops for creatives aged 14\\u201321, designed and curated by the Burnt Orange Youth Board. This is young people taking the lead, creating the space, skills, and conversations they know are most needed right now.&nbsp;Every session has been imagined by young creatives themselves, their questions, their challenges, and their ambitions; making the programme unlike anything else available. It\\u2019s not adults telling you what to do. It\\u2019s peers and near-peers building a toolkit for the next generation of artists.&nbsp;&nbsp;What to expect&nbsp;The workshops are wide-ranging, covering both artistic and personal development. Together, you\\u2019ll explore:&nbsp;\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Creative skills \\u2013 from movement and voice to writing, devising, and self-taping.&nbsp;\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Industry know-how \\u2013 producing your own work, navigating auditions, and understanding the business side of creativity.&nbsp;\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Wellbeing and resilience \\u2013 tackling the pressures of being a young artist, overcoming creative block, and finding sustainable ways to thrive.&nbsp;\\u00b7&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Collaboration \\u2013 learning how to work across disciplines, share ideas, and spark new projects with your peers.&nbsp;Each session stands alone, so you can pick and choose the topics that excite you most. But if you commit to multiple workshops, you\\u2019ll benefit from a joined-up journey, building a stronger skillset, deeper confidence, and lasting creative friendships.&nbsp;&nbsp;Why youth-led matters&nbsp;The Burnt Orange Youth Board created this series because they know what\\u2019s missing for young people in the arts. They\\u2019ve been through the hurdles of auditioning, studying, and trying to access opportunities, and they want to pass on what they wish they\\u2019d had when starting out. This makes For Us, By Us immediately relevant, practical, and rooted in lived experience.&nbsp;Burnt Orange Theatre is a multi-award-winning Community Interest Company (CIC) that creates professional-level opportunities tailored for young people. We work to industry standard while ensuring accessibility, so every young creative has a fair chance to take the next step in their journey.&nbsp;\\u201cWhat a pleasure to have such a free, fast-paced, fulfilling environment to experiment and grow as a young actor. Burnt Orange are incredible facilitators and craft such a freeing atmosphere for young people.\\u201d \\u2013 Participant Feedback 2025&nbsp;Don\\u2019t miss out - join For Us, By Us and experience a workshop series shaped by young people, for young people. Book your sessions now and be part of the movement.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/a7dd1747398147d6ccb9558fe1324f6f.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-15T18:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-05-08T18:00:00+01:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/gQ-for-us-by-us-workshop-series/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz-focus-inner,[type=button]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=reset]::-moz-focus-inner,[type=submit]::-moz-focus-inner{border-style:none;padding:0}button:-moz-focusring,[type=button]:-moz-focusring,[type=reset]:-moz-focusring,[type=submit]:-moz-focusring{outline:1px dotted ButtonText}fieldset{padding:.35em .75em .625em}legend{box