          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Hanging Plant Holder Workshop | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you’ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new! Plants are\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Hanging Plant Holder Workshop\",\"description\":\"What better way to start the new year than to get creative, try something new and feel good whilst doing it!In this workshop, you\\u2019ll design and make a beautiful one-off hanging plant holder to display your plants and celebrate all things new!&nbsp; Plants are calming and energising and your hanging plant holder will most certainly live up to this brief \\u2013 whilst adding something special to your interiors.&nbsp; Your plant holder design will elevate any plant and take it to new heights, whilst enhancing its visibility and creating a charming focal point.&nbsp;This workshop includes guidance from a trained creative eye - all the materials you\\u2019ll need to create a unique piece, and lots of inspiration, tips, tricks and conversation along the way!&nbsp; No experience is necessary just the desire to try something new and get creative!&nbsp; Book your place to join us and make an item you\\u2019ll enjoy for many years to come!&nbsp;&nbsp;About CURATE &amp; MORE&nbsp;Curate &amp; More design and facilitate creative experiences and events \\u2013 with an emphasis on art, design, fashion and interiors.&nbsp; Workshops encourage, engage and inspire participants in their collaborative and individual creative stories whilst promoting creative processes and the joy of making by hand!&nbsp;To find out more about CURATE &amp; MORE events and services visit our website here&nbsp;\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/b45a3b6a4d5a8ebf86ae86adf3b328eb.png\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-17T11:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/gp-hanging-plant-holder-workshop/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:none}button,input,optgroup,select,textarea{font-family:inherit;font-size:100%;line-height:1.15;margin:0}button,input{overflow:visible}button,select{text-transform:none}button,[type=button],[type=reset],[type=submit]{-webkit-appearance:button}button::-moz-focus-