          "content": {
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Young Riverscribes | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Join Burnt Orange Theatre’s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.“Burnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the ver\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Young Riverscribes\",\"description\":\"Join Burnt Orange Theatre\\u2019s brand-new Young Riverscribes project, created in partnership with Riverside Studios.\\u201cBurnt Orange are a vital cog in the mad machine that is the world of theatre: a world where chances are dwindling away for all but the very lucky who can afford it.\\u201d \\u2013 Everything Theatre&nbsp;Young Riverscribes is more than a youth theatre, it's a revolutionary creative platform designed with and for young people aged 14\\u201321. Over a series of dynamic workshops, you\\u2019ll gain the skills and confidence to collaborate, create, and perform both as an individual artist and as part of a thriving ensemble.&nbsp;At the heart of the project is Demystify, our unique built-in support system offering insider industry knowledge every step of the way. Expect Q&amp;As, networking opportunities, guest professionals, and practical guidance that will help you navigate the creative industries with clarity and confidence.&nbsp;Each fortnightly session is led by the Burnt Orange team alongside special guests such as casting assistants, agents, drama school tutors, and working artists. Every workshop is tailored to the passions and needs of the group, covering:&nbsp;\\u25cf Performing scripted work&nbsp;\\u25cf Writing and devising&nbsp;\\u25cf Directing and creative leadership&nbsp;\\u25cf Screen acting skills&nbsp;\\u25cf Scratch night opportunities&nbsp;\\u25cf And any other creative roles you\\u2019re eager to explore&nbsp;&nbsp;Young Riverscribes is designed to grow with you; the more sessions you attend, the more your skills and creative relationships will develop. We encourage participants to commit to multiple sessions to build a collaborative ensemble, and discounted booking is available when you sign up for more than one.&nbsp;If cost is a barrier, free places are available. Just contact us directly at burntorange.theatre@gmail.com.&nbsp;&nbsp;\\u201cIt is evident to me that Burnt Orange Theatre understand young people, their context and what motivates them.\\u201d \\u2013 Workshop Feedback 2024&nbsp;Ready to take the leap? Book your place in Young Riverscribes today and start building your creative future.&nbsp;\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/d5b9e9d6d62bdca12eac9792da3e548a.jpg\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-18T11:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-29T11:00:00+01:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/gn-young-riverscribes/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:con