 role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Community & Partnership Enquiries                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n            <div class=\"nav-item \">\r\n              <a class=\"nav-title has-icon search\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/search/\"><span>Search</span></a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </nav>\r\n          <nav class=\"shop-nav container mobile-only-break-1024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"member-nav\" data-url=\"https://spektrix.riversidestudios.co.uk/riversidestudios/api/v3/customer?$expand=subscriptions\" class=\"nav-item\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-item\">\r\n            \t<a draggable=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title has-icon basket basket-trigger\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/basket/\"><span>Basket</span> </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"nav-item acc\">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"acs-button\" aria-label = \"Open Accessibility menu\">\r\n                <span>Accessibility</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </nav>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\n  <div class=\"video-modals\"></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo riverside-logo\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo studios-logo\"><span></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"membership-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay-login\"></div>\n    <main class=\"outer-container\"  id=\"main-content\"  >\n      <div class=\"filter-overlay\"></div>\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page page-event\">\r\n  <section class=\"template template-event-detail play-container has-modal  has-text-bottom      \">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w880/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1210/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1470/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1680/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1870/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w2048/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w2880/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 43.9% 26.1% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w880/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;43.9&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;26.1&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;3013&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;2515&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w880/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1210/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1470/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1680/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w1870/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w2048/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/ff/0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958/w2880/q80/images/uploads/ff0350302876f3b0711e107c0f93a958.jpeg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Writing Dialogue</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Sun 18 Jan 2026 13:00</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"emM3RTF3bWhuUzRlWHZHRXJ2b2haZz09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><i><strong>Led by Nick Dawkins</strong></i></p><p>This workshop is an in-depth dive into dialogue - a crucial element of storytelling. We will look at how you can use dialogue to express character, themes as well as subtle techniques to bury your exposition. What makes dialogue natural verses stylised, as well as how certain trends in dialogue have gone in and out of fashion over the years.</p><p>All levels of experience are welcome, whether you're a writer for theatre, film, television, radio, or any other form of storytelling, we aim to help you discover and refine your own style of writing over the course of this workshop.&nbsp;</p><p>Nick Dawkins is a writer and dramaturg whose last play, <i><strong>A Manchester Anthem</strong></i>, won multiple awards including Pleasance Pick of the VAULT Festival, Show of the Week VAULT Festival and Broadway Baby's Bobby Award, as well as being nominated twice for an Off West End Award and having a 3 week run at Riverside Studios. He has a MA in Writing for Stage and Broadcast Media from The Royal Central School of Speech and Drama and his work has been performed at Southwark Playhouse, The Space, The Vaults and The Pleasance Theatre.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">90 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n                        <div id=\"member-login\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-nav-top\">\r\n                                <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">Our Website</h5>\r\n                                <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/privacy-and-cookies/\">Privacy and Cookies</a>\r\n                              <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" hr