os.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/community-partnership-enquiries/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Community & Partnership Enquiries\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Community & Partnership Enquiries                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n            <div class=\"nav-item \">\r\n              <a class=\"nav-title has-icon search\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/search/\"><span>Search</span></a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </nav>\r\n          <nav class=\"shop-nav container mobile-only-break-1024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"member-nav\" data-url=\"https://spektrix.riversidestudios.co.uk/riversidestudios/api/v3/customer?$expand=subscriptions\" class=\"nav-item\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-item\">\r\n            \t<a draggable=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title has-icon basket basket-trigger\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/basket/\"><span>Basket</span> </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"nav-item acc\">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"acs-button\" aria-label = \"Open Accessibility menu\">\r\n                <span>Accessibility</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </nav>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\n  <div class=\"video-modals\"></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo riverside-logo\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo studios-logo\"><span></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"membership-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay-login\"></div>\n    <main class=\"outer-container\"  id=\"main-content\"  >\n      <div class=\"filter-overlay\"></div>\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page page-event\">\r\n  <section class=\"template template-event-detail play-container has-modal  has-text-bottom      \">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w880/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1210/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/wpojpg/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 53.0% 35.9% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w880/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;53.0&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;35.9&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;1366&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;768&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;landscape&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w880/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1210/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/88/2e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63/w1366/q80/images/uploads/882e26dc499b0b32ea691709f57d3f63.jpg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Introduction to Puppetry Workshop</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Thu 22 Jan 2026 18:00</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"ZHZHUFRzZE1YTit4ZUtIWmxsSEtzdz09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><strong>The Horgles</strong> are a puppetry duo consisting of Kyle Moss and Ceilbí. They have worked with <strong>Oliver Award Winning</strong> Irish theatre company <strong>Fishamble </strong>and have collaborated with <strong>Theatre Deli</strong>, <strong>New Diorama</strong>,<strong> Theatre503 </strong>and <strong>Camden People’s Theatre</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p>Ceilbí is a queer trans non-binary puppetmaker, puppeteer, writer and director. Their show <i>A Xerox of a Deer</i> was a smash hit at<strong> Edinburgh Fringe</strong> in 2025, with Binge Fringe calling it one of the Top 25 shows to see!&nbsp;</p><p>Kyle Moss is a puppeteer, writer, and performer. They were a <strong>BBC top 1% writer</strong> for 2025 and a Screen Ireland Finalist. They have studied puppetry at Little Angel Theatre under Oliver Hymans.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>In this workshop we will introduce you to the world of puppetry in relation to live theatrical performance. From Character, Voice, Movement and Breath work, we will start to understand what makes a puppet come to life.&nbsp;</p><p>We perform with ‘Muppet-Style’ puppets, and will be teaching the basics of both rod arm and live hand.</p><p>At the end of this <strong>Introduction to Puppetry</strong> workshop we will give you the tools to go out into the world and have the key fundamentals of puppetry performance in a theatrical set up.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">90 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n                        <div id=\"member-login\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-nav-top\">\r\n                       