            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Mime Principles | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential \">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Mime Principles\",\"description\":\"Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom PerryThis workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.&nbsp;All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.&nbsp;Francesca Fatichenti is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell\\u2019Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d\\u2019une Nuit d\\u2019\\u00c9t\\u00e9 (Italy\\u2013France, 2023), and La Folie d\\u2019Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre.&nbsp;Tom Parry is the founder and co-principle of the mime company \\u2018Partners in Mime\\u2019 - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes \\u2018A brief foray into online dating\\u2019 in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-01-31T13:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-01-31T13:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/b1-mime-principles/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}a{background-color:transparent}abbr[title]{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:underline;-webkit-text-decoration:underline dotted;text-decoration:underline dotted}b,strong{font-weight:bolder}code,kbd,samp{font-family:monospace,monospace;font-size:1em}small{font-size:80%}sub,sup{font-size:75%;line-height:0;position:relative;vertical-align:baseline}sub{bottom:-0.25em}sup{top:-0.5em}img{border-style:non