 Hire                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/bring-a-show-or-workshop/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Bring a Show or Workshop\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Bring a Show or Workshop                  </a>\n                                    <a  href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/hire-us-work-with-us/community-partnership-enquiries/\" class=\"sub-nav-item font-sub-nav font-bold font-blue\" title=\"Community & Partnership Enquiries\" role=\"menuitem\">\n                      Community & Partnership Enquiries                  </a>\n                                            </div>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n            <div class=\"nav-item \">\r\n              <a class=\"nav-title has-icon search\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/search/\"><span>Search</span></a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </nav>\r\n          <nav class=\"shop-nav container mobile-only-break-1024\">\r\n                        <div class=\"member-nav\" data-url=\"https://spektrix.riversidestudios.co.uk/riversidestudios/api/v3/customer?$expand=subscriptions\" class=\"nav-item\"></div>\r\n                        <div class=\"nav-item\">\r\n            \t<a draggable=\"false\"  class=\"nav-title has-icon basket basket-trigger\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/basket/\"><span>Basket</span> </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"nav-item acc\">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"acs-button\" aria-label = \"Open Accessibility menu\">\r\n                <span>Accessibility</span>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </nav>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</header>\n  <div class=\"video-modals\"></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo riverside-logo\"><span></span></div>\n  <div class=\"side-logo studios-logo\"><span></span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"membership-container\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay\"></div>\n    <div class=\"overlay-login\"></div>\n    <main class=\"outer-container\"  id=\"main-content\"  >\n      <div class=\"filter-overlay\"></div>\n          \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"page page-event\">\r\n  <section class=\"template template-event-detail play-container has-modal  has-text-bottom      \">\r\n\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"template-top header-padding header-switch\">\r\n                <div class=\"image-container \">\r\n                                <picture>\r\n                    <source sizes=\"100vw\" type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w880/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1210/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1470/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1680/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1870/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w2048/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w2880/q80/wpojpeg/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.webp 2880w\">\r\n                                <img fetchpriority=\"high\" sizes=\"100vw\"  style=\"object-position: 52.6% 48.2% \" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w880/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg\"  data-custom=\"{&quot;img_src&quot;:&quot;images\\/uploads\\/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg&quot;,&quot;fx&quot;:&quot;52.6&quot;,&quot;fy&quot;:&quot;48.2&quot;,&quot;original&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:&quot;3024&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:&quot;4032&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;portrait&quot;}}\"  srcset=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w880/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 880w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1210/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 1210w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1470/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 1470w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1680/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w1870/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w2048/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/6a/05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b/w2880/q80/images/uploads/6a05c7b83e5759b47b41aaff20e7008b.jpeg 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Mime Principles</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Sat 31 Jan 2026 13:00</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"L0JDbUQwbjE5MWVFcjJIWldOaDFxdz09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p><i><strong>Led by Francesca Fatichenti and Tom Perry</strong></i></p><p>This workshop is a close look at mime, an important element of physical theatre. We will look at manipulation, fix point, character change, storytelling techniques, the 20 Lecoq elements, walks and other essential elements to compose a mime sequence.&nbsp;</p><p>All levels are welcome, whether you are an experienced physical actor looking to refresh your tools, or you just want to try something completely new. We will aim to reconnect you with your body, and expand your ability to narrate a story through it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Francesca Fatichenti</strong> is an actress who trained extensively in physical theatre and Commedia dell’Arte, clowning, Lecoq and Decroux technique. She has worked with renowned masters including Philippe Gaulier and Carlo Boso. Her credits in physical theatre include Retrogusto Pop (Italy, 2025), The Green Bird (Edinburgh, 2023), Le Songe d’une Nuit d’Été (Italy–France, 2023), and La Folie d’Isabella (Avignon, 2022). She has also performed at the National Theatre of Italy, Tate Britain and National Theatre of Romania. She is the <strong>Artistic Director of Psychonaut Theatre</strong>.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Tom Parry</strong> is the founder and co-principle of the mime company ‘Partners in Mime’ - a group that specialises in the provision of engaging interactive entertainment. Tom is trained in the methods belonging to the national circus academy of Ukraine by internationally acclaimed mime artist Anetta Anisimova. In addition to his work in entertainment, Tom is also active in the cabaret and alternative comedy circuit. This includes ‘A brief foray into online dating’ in collaboration with Francesca Fatichenti.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">90 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class