.JPG 1680w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/63/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9/w682/q80/images/uploads/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.JPG 1870w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/63/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9/w682/q80/images/uploads/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.JPG 2048w,https://riversidestudios.co.uk/images/custom/63/5e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9/w682/q80/images/uploads/635e7580c03f13f27d14da28a391f7d9.JPG 2880w\" alt=\"\">\r\n                                </picture>\r\n                \r\n                            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"template-content-outer\">\r\n\r\n          <div class=\"template-content\">\r\n            <div class=\"container \">\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"template-content-inner \">\r\n\r\n                                                        <div class=\"template-title-top\">\r\n                    <h1 class=\"template-title font-title font-xlarge font-uppercase \">\r\n                       <span>Hancock's Half Hour Triple Bill: Part XI</span>\r\n              \r\n                     </h1>\r\n                                            <div class=\"template-tag\"></div>\r\n                    </div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n                  <div class=\"template-content-top\">\r\n                     <div class=\"template-date performance-date-range  font-uppercase font-tag font-title\"><span>Sat 31 Jan 2026 14:00</span></div>\r\n\r\n                  </div>\r\n                                    \r\n               \r\n\r\n           <div class=\"booking-info\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"booking-info-inner\">\r\n            <div class=\"cta-bar \" id=\"event-info\" data-hash=\"RStJVzNTZWF2eklMMXlycHFqNGkwQT09\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      \r\n            </div>\r\n\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n\r\n      <div class=\"template-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n          <div class=\"template-bottom-inner \">\r\n            <div class=\"template-left   \">\r\n\r\n                          <div class=\"te\">\r\n    <p>Proudly presented as part of our <strong>MADE AT RIVERSIDE TV</strong> strand; celebrating the long history of film and TV production at Riverside Studios. Here we continue our longstanding celebration of the inimitable Tony Hancock, with a further three episodes of Hancock's classic work.<strong> The Tony Hancock Appreciation Society</strong> will introduce and discuss the episode afterwards as usual.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Episodes:</p><p><i>Hancock's Half Hour: The New Nose (Made at Riverside)</i></p><p><i>Hancock (1963 ATV Series): The Eye Witness</i></p><p><i>Hancock: The Bedsitter</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With thanks to our collaborators on this event, the <strong>Tony Hancock Appreciation Society,</strong> the estates of writers Ray Galton and Alan Simpson, the estate of Tony Hancock, and the British Film Institute.</p></div>            \r\n\r\n            \r\n\r\n         </div>\r\n\r\n           <aside class=\"template-right\">\r\n               <div class=\"event-details\">\r\n                \r\n                  <div class=\"event-detail-section event-info\">\r\n                      <div class=\"rating-info font-tag font-uppercase font-title font-blue \">Duration:  </div>\r\n                      <span class=\"event-info-text age-rating text\">150 minutes</span>\r\n                    </div>                  \r\n                    \r\n                  \r\n                  \r\n                                  <div id=\"event-performances\" class=\"performance_details\"></div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n               </div>\r\n\r\n           </aside>\r\n       \r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      </section>\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n</div>\r\n  </main>\n\r\n<footer class=\"footer\">\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container-wide desktop-only-break-1024\">\r\n    <div class=\"footer-inner\">\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-navs\">\r\n\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n                            <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">See Also</h5>\r\n                            <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/newsletter-signup/\">Newsletter signup</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/vacancies/\">Vacancies</a>\r\n                          <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/policies/\">Policies</a>\r\n                        <div id=\"member-login\"></div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n                  <div class=\"footer-section\">\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"footer-nav-top\">\r\n                                <h5 class=\"footer-nav-title font-xxsmall font-title font-uppercase font-white\">Our Website</h5>\r\n                                <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/privacy-and-cookies/\">Privacy and Cookies</a>\r\n                              <a class=\"footer-nav-item font-text font-white\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/website-accessibility/\">Website Accessibility</a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n        \r\n        \r\n              </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer-logos\">\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"footer-social\">\r\n            <div class=\"footer-social-inner\">\r\n              <nav class=\"social-icons \">\r\n                <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/RiversideStudiosLondon/\" class=\"facebook\" title=\"Facebook\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Facebook</span></a>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/riversidestudioslondon/?hl=en\" class=\"instagram\" title=\"Instagram\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Instagram</span></a>\r\n<a href=\"https://twitter.com/RiversideLondon\" class=\"x-twitter\" title=\"X\"\r\n   target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"sr-only\">X</span></a>\r\n              </nav>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n\r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"footer-legal\">\r\n        <span class=\"footer-copy font-tiny font-white\">&copy; Anil Agarwal Riverside Studios Trust. All rights reserved.</span>\r\n        <a href=\"https://grandad.digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" class=\"footer-credit font-tiny font-white\">Site by Grandad.digital</a>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n</footer>\n<div id=\"event-sidebar-bg\" class=\"event-sidebar-bg\"></div>\n<div id=\"event-sidebar\" class=\"event-sidebar\"></div>\n<div class=\"modal\" id=\"modal\"></div>\n\n\n\n<script>window.MSInputMethodContext && document.documentMode && document.write('');</script>\n\n\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/jquery.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/jqueryui.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/js.cookie.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/plyr.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/headroom.js?v=aa56b3dd13b23fb4ad32a13439ede610\"></script>\n<script defer type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/js/vendor/body-scroll-lock.js?v=a