            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Have you ever watched a bad film and thought ‘I can do better than that?’ The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative e\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Riverscribes: Introduction to Screenwriting\",\"description\":\"Have you ever watched a bad film and thought \\u2018I can do better than that?\\u2019 The chances are you can!Join Netflix screenwriter Henry Fitzherbert for a series of workshops that strip away the mystique of writing for the screen in a fun and collaborative environment.It\\u2019s Henry\\u2019s firm belief that anyone, armed with the right tools, can write a screenplay and you\\u2019ll explore all the essentials of the craft - from what makes a compelling character - to theme, structure and story world.Bring your own idea or draft screenplay to discuss with the group, or simply come to be inspired with like-minded creatives.The sessions are open to complete beginners, or more experienced writers looking for inspiration.Don\\u2019t just dream. Do it!&nbsp;About Henry Fitzherbert:Henry is a screenwriter for film and television and will bring a wealth of experience and insights from working with Hollywood studios, streamers, A-list actors and directors and numerous British and American production companies.He co-wrote the hit Netflix series WYATT EARP &amp; THE COWBOY WAR (2024), which reached Number 3 globally and was a top ten hit in 47 countries. Narrated by Ed Harris, the series explores the legend of Wild West lawman Wyatt Earp and the untold true story behind the most famous shoot-out in American history, The Gunfight At The O.K. Corral. It received rave reviews.Previously, Henry wrote BORN A KING (2019), a $21 million historical drama and coming-of-age story which broke box office records across the Gulf and Middle East, opening at Number 1. Directed by Goya winner Agust\\u00ed Villaronga, it won Best Film at the Inward Eye Film Festival, Lake District.He co-wrote SLAUGHTERHOUSE RULEZ (2018), a comedy-horror set in a British boarding school with an all star cast, including Asa Butterfield, Simon Pegg, Nick Frost, Michael Sheen, Finn Cole and Margot Robbie.A former journalist, Henry is a Visiting Lecturer at the London Film School and has taught at numerous film schools and writers\\u2019 workshops.Website: henryfitzherbert.com\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/685409852abaf9c71d6584a396dd7f51.png\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-02-10T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-03-24T19:00:00+00:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/by-riverscribes-introduction-to-screenwriting/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=5, user-scalable=yes\"/>\n<link rel=\"dns-prefetch\" href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\">\n\n\n\n<style>/*! normalize.css v8.0.1 | MIT License | github.com/necolas/normalize.css */html{line-height:1.15;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}body{margin:0}main{display:block}h1{font-size:2em;margin:.67em 0}hr{box-sizing:content-box;height:0;overflow:visible}pre{