            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"no-js\">\n\n<head>\n  <title>Sweet Sounds Of The South | Riverside Studios</title>\n\n    <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Evol creations’ Riverside Folk and Blues Music Nights presents:Sweet Sounds of the South Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance,\">\n    \n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\n<meta name=\"generator\" content=\"Grandad Digital - Powered by You.Create Content Management System\">\n<meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=Edge\">\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n  \"url\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/\",\n  \"logo\": \"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/assets/img/logo.png\"\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Event\",\"name\":\"Sweet Sounds Of The South\",\"description\":\"Evol creations\\u2019 Riverside Folk and Blues Music Nights presents:Sweet Sounds of the South&nbsp;Evol Creation is an interdisciplinary arts company focusing on reintroducing ritual into modern theater and exploring the grey area of morality through performance, visual art, movement, and music. Without an audience, there is no show; we immerse our audience in a world where they and the performers work together and create a place where people come, not to escape, but to be part of the story.\",\"image\":[\"https:\\/\\/riversidestudios.co.uk\\/images\\/uploads\\/7615530b2a2795e0bc9d4216b8369002.png\"],\"startDate\":\"2026-03-07T19:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2026-05-16T19:00:00+01:00\",\"eventStatus\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\\/EventScheduled\"}</script>\n\n    <link href=\"https://riversidestudios.co.uk/whats-on/Nj-sweet-sounds-of-the-south/\" rel=\"canonical\"/>\n\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scal